bility map; wired into DeviceOut.reachable\n- main.py: lifespan starts/stops scheduler, gated on enable_scheduler (off in tests → no hang)\n- config: poll/backup/verify/reconciler intervals + crons, enable_scheduler\n- deps: apscheduler\n\nValidation gate: make check (243 tests, 23.8s, no hang) + traced reconciler idempotency +\nno-double-apply + lifespan gating + boot smoke. PASS. Tests 222→243. pyright 0 errors.","tree":{"sha":"cb82fb6be2a4aba65ee8f44ec631d41642527c8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/trees/cb82fb6be2a4aba65ee8f44ec631d41642527c8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/commits/f1241164cd1a9af4a30cf9fa045634befec8253f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/f1241164cd1a9af4a30cf9fa045634befec8253f","node_id":"C_kwDOSZdL19oAKGYxMjQxMTY0Y2QxYTlhZjRhMzBjZjlmYTA0NTYzNGJlZmVjODI1M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/4837818b466f30049de8ada2a6715ddd1163ed65","sha":"4837818b466f30049de8ada2a6715ddd1163ed65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/4837818b466f30049de8ada2a6715ddd1163ed65"}],"sha":"f1241164cd1a9af4a30cf9fa045634befec8253f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/f1241164cd1a9af4a30cf9fa045634befec8253f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/4837818b466f30049de8ada2a6715ddd1163ed65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T22:16:35Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T22:16:35Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"message":"backend: services core — TTL cache, change-request state machine, apply flow, audit hash-chain\n\nD2/D3/D4/D6 from architecture, the critical path:\n- _lib/cache.py: LRUCache (DLL+hashmap) + TTLCache subclass (per-entry expiry, MISS sentinel)\n- services/port_state.py: 30s TTL cache, port_metadata merge, device_state_fingerprint (sha256)\n- services/requests.py: persisted state machine — _LEGAL transition table, IllegalTransition→409,\n  every transition writes ChangeRequestEvent (reconciler recovery log); create captures fingerprint\n  + assert_writable fail-fast\n- services/change_apply.py: 12-step apply — assert_writable → stale-state drift guard (block, status\n  unchanged) → applying → backup → render → apply_change → audit → awaiting_confirm/applied; failure→\n  failed; status+token+deadline persisted for crash-safe reconciler resume\n- services/audit.py: append-only sha256 hash chain (prev_hash+canonical_json), GENESIS root,\n  verify_chain returns break index, cred fields [REDACTED], zero UPDATE/DELETE\n- api/ports.py + requests.py + audit.py: ports (get/metadata-edit/config/backup/diff), request\n  lifecycle (create/approve/apply/reject/confirm + mine/status filters), audit query\n- config: commit_confirm_seconds, port_state_ttl_seconds, capacity\n\nValidation gate: make check + traced SM legality + apply crash-safety + drift guard + hash-chain\ntamper detection. PASS. Tests 176→222. pyright 0 errors. cache.py was genuinely new (prior LRU\nlost in fs incident; config used stdlib lru_cache).","tree":{"sha":"138a7b691822173b41e82b18d3f40533322e83c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/trees/138a7b691822173b41e82b18d3f40533322e83c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/commits/4837818b466f30049de8ada2a6715ddd1163ed65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/4837818b466f30049de8ada2a6715ddd1163ed65","node_id":"C_kwDOSZdL19oAKDQ4Mzc4MThiNDY2ZjMwMDQ5ZGU4YWRhMmE2NzE1ZGRkMTE2M2VkNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/de17e009b1df4d07810da2828186e94a53e0b626","sha":"de17e009b1df4d07810da2828186e94a53e0b626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/de17e009b1df4d07810da2828186e94a53e0b626"}],"sha":"4837818b466f30049de8ada2a6715ddd1163ed65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/4837818b466f30049de8ada2a6715ddd1163ed65"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/de17e009b1df4d07810da2828186e94a53e0b626/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:57:41Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:57:41Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"message":"backend: devices CRUD + onboarding wizard backend + read-only policy\n\n- api/devices.py: test-connection + discover (no persist) + atomic POST onboard +\n  list/get + rotate-creds (re-test gated) + delete (cascade + audit)\n- services/onboarding.py: atomic onboard via savepoint — discover before any DB hit,\n  device + port_metadata + config_backup + audit in one tx, rollback = zero orphans\n- services/device_policy.py: assert_writable chokepoint — blocks router/vpn roles +\n  writable=false platforms + fail-closed on unknown platform (guards config writes,\n  NOT registration of read-only devices)\n- drivers/factory.py: driver_from_params / driver_for over registry\n- schemas/device.py: Pydantic v2 DTOs; DeviceOut excludes creds\n- description parse: VLAN-X|model|bmc → port_metadata host_model/bmc_ip\n\nValidation gate: make check + traced atomic-rollback (zero orphans) + creds-never-\nexposed + assert_writable fail-closed. PASS. Tests 154→176. pyright 0 errors.","tree":{"sha":"a0df64c61793aa219b19e85ffc6f13194ed2f318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/trees/a0df64c61793aa219b19e85ffc6f13194ed2f318"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git