stub warn).","tree":{"sha":"a161d4b45ab151a9dac5c929abf6a388dcacc987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/trees/a161d4b45ab151a9dac5c929abf6a388dcacc987"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/commits/196b8c66a042d8ecc907b23eccc80ce0d5af68ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/196b8c66a042d8ecc907b23eccc80ce0d5af68ad","node_id":"C_kwDOSZdL19oAKDE5NmI4YzY2YTA0MmQ4ZWNjOTA3YjIzZWNjYzgwY2UwZDVhZjY4YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/f4a3e9d82db05e1cda67443533e94da21d0dd4f4","sha":"f4a3e9d82db05e1cda67443533e94da21d0dd4f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/f4a3e9d82db05e1cda67443533e94da21d0dd4f4"}],"sha":"196b8c66a042d8ecc907b23eccc80ce0d5af68ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/196b8c66a042d8ecc907b23eccc80ce0d5af68ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/f4a3e9d82db05e1cda67443533e94da21d0dd4f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:38:22Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:38:22Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"message":"backend: DB layer (async SQLAlchemy 2.0 + Alembic) + Fernet CredVault\n\n8 tables: users, devices, port_metadata, change_requests, change_request_events,\naudit_log, config_backups (+ alembic_version). SQLAlchemy 2.0 typed Mapped[] style,\nUUID str pks, enum values_callable persists lowercase values, FKs enforced.\n- db.py: async engine, WAL+busy_timeout+FK pragmas, async_sessionmaker, get_session dep\n- CredVault: cryptography Fernet, fail-closed on tamper (InvalidToken→DecryptionError),\n  master key from NB_MASTER_KEY, hard-fail outside dev, ephemeral+warn in dev\n- config: db_url, master_key, environment via TOML+NB_ env\n- Alembic: async env.py, initial migration, upgrade/downgrade round-trips, parity verified\n- deps: sqlalchemy[asyncio], aiosqlite, alembic, cryptography\n\nValidation gate: independent make check + migration parity + crypto/enum trace. PASS.\nTests 109→133. pyright 0 errors.","tree":{"sha":"d104756f429e569427ce239adbd07d9a0f9f615a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/trees/d104756f429e569427ce239adbd07d9a0f9f615a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/commits/f4a3e9d82db05e1cda67443533e94da21d0dd4f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/f4a3e9d82db05e1cda67443533e94da21d0dd4f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSZdL19oAKGY0YTNlOWQ4MmRiMDVlMWNkYTY3NDQzNTMzZTk0ZGEyMWQwZGQ0ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/6dece4b5380027d8fc1a975160a9392169d11bb7","sha":"6dece4b5380027d8fc1a975160a9392169d11bb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/6dece4b5380027d8fc1a975160a9392169d11bb7"}],"sha":"f4a3e9d82db05e1cda67443533e94da21d0dd4f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/f4a3e9d82db05e1cda67443533e94da21d0dd4f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/6dece4b5380027d8fc1a975160a9392169d11bb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:28:49Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:28:49Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"message":"backend: Cisco driver (NX-API JSON-RPC + IOS SSH fallback)\n\nCiscoDriver — platform_id=cisco, writable, native commit-confirm.\n- NX-API path (prefer_native_api): JSON-RPC POST /ins, cli/cli_ascii, HTTP Basic\n  via HttpxClient. Full read + commit-confirm write (checkpoint + rollback delay).\n- SSH fallback path (asyncssh): read-only (test/reachable/config/ports);\n  write raises NotSupported.\n- Parsers: show interface, switchport, vlan, lldp neighbors detail, version.\n  NX-API JSON keys parsed defensively w/ aliases (flagged for lab validation).\n- LLDP via _lib/lldp normalizers. No new deps (reused httpx+asyncssh transports).\n\nTests: 82 → 109 (+21 cisco unit + 6 contract auto-param). make check clean.\n/api/platforms: [arista, cisco, mock, pica8]. MikroTik dropped per scope change.","tree":{"sha":"1ae1d25446f605bfe6624d741f0cef3b5acb5069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/trees/1ae1d25446f605bfe6624d741f0cef3b5acb5069"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/commits/6dece4b5380027d8fc1a975160a9392169d11bb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/6dece4b5380027d8fc1a975160a9392169d11bb7","node_id":"C_kwDOSZdL19oAKDZkZWNlNGI1MzgwMDI3ZDhmYzFhOTc1MTYwYTkzOTIxNjlkMTFiYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/4c202b6e280510f18a541ab01828c00580b595c1","sha":"4c202b6e280510f18a541ab01828c00580b595c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/4c202b6e280510f18a541ab01828c00580b595c1"}],"sha":"6dece4b5380027d8fc1a975160a9392169d11bb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/6dece4b5380027d8fc1a975160a9392169d11bb7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/4c202b6e280510f18a541ab01828c00580b595c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:18:44Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:18:44Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"message":"test: wire contract suite to driver_factory mock fixtures (conftest)\n\nReconciles divergence — conftest.py mock transports were untracked. Contract\nsuite now injects mocked eAPI/NETCONF transports for arista/pica8 so it runs\noffline. 82/82 pytest green.","tree":{"sha":"5e5a6b3fceb3b1733f480ae0d24d6c89732a98c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/trees/5e5a6b3fceb3b1733f480ae0d24d6c89732a98c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/commits/4c202b6e280510f18a541ab01828c00580b595c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/4c202b6e280510f18a541ab01828c00580b595c1","node_id":"C_kwDOSZdL19oAKDRjMjAyYjZlMjgwNTEwZjE4YTU0MWFiMDE4MjhjMDA1ODBiNTk1YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/00f279da7e0e6589b4a779df2980d85a6235feb9","sha":"00f279da7e0e6589b4a779df2980d85a6235feb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/00f279da7e0e6589b4a779df2980d85a6235feb9"}],"sha":"4c202b6e280510f18a541ab01828c00580b595c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/4c202b6e280510f18a541ab01828c00580b595c1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/00f279da7e0e6589b4a779df2980d85a6235feb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:19:35Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-23T21:19:35Z","email":"vishnu.v@karios.ai","name":"VishnuV"},"message":"backend: Arista (eAPI + commit-timer) + Pica8 (NETCONF + confirmed-commit) drivers\n\nF11 + F162 extensions — two real drivers with native commit-confirm:\n\nArista (~556 LOC):\n- HttpxClient transport (eAPI JSON-RPC over HTTPS POST /command-api)\n- parse_interfaces + parse_switchport + parse_lldp via canned fixtures\n- render_change builds CLI commands; apply wraps in ''configure session NB-X'' + ''commit timer''\n- confirm = ''commit''; revert = ''abort''\n- session-name passed via new ConfigDiff.metadata field\n\nPica8 (~452 LOC):\n- NetconfClient transport (ncclient + threadpool, port 830)\n- _has_child() helper for boolean XML tags like <disable/>\n- parse_interfaces + parse_lldp on lxml etree\n- render_change builds <edit-config> XML; apply via commit(confirmed=True, timeout=N)\n- confirm = commit(); revert = discard_changes()\n- pending_token via ConfigDiff.metadata\n\nSchema:\n- ConfigDiff.metadata: dict[str, str] — driver-specific hints (session name, token)\n\nRegistry fix:\n- register() now uses TypeVar[bound=Driver] — preserves subclass type\n  through the decorator. Pyright was erasing Pica8Driver/AristaDriver\n  to bare Driver, breaking constructor kwarg recognition.\n\nTests: 82/82 pytest, ruff clean, pyright 0 errors 0 warnings.\n/api/platforms now returns [arista, mock, pica8].\n\nVendor fixtures: tests/fixtures/{arista,pica8}/ — show_interfaces.json,\nshow_lldp.json, show_switchport.json, get_interfaces.xml, get_lldp.xml.","tree":{"sha":"ebb0d5b4bb84d5d755976739bc1ce3f1def611a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/trees/ebb0d5b4bb84d5d755976739bc1ce3f1def611a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/git/commits/00f279da7e0e6589b4a779df2980d85a6235feb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/00f279da7e0e6589b4a779df2980d85a6235feb9","node_id":"C_kwDOSZdL19oAKDAwZjI3OWRhN2UwZTY1ODliNGE3NzlkZjI5ODBkODVhNjIzNWZlYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commit/e0a69b9d9977f6367d9b859d7d2b4ee8eefe67f2","sha":"e0a69b9d9977f6367d9b859d7d2b4ee8eefe67f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VishnuVuggepalli/Northbound/commits/e0a69b9d9977f6367d9b859d7d2b4ee8eefe6