 → see NG0203 in console.\n\nToggle remote/vite.config.ts shared config between scenarios.","tree":{"sha":"03859dae9510eb07c0cd14aa65c02def82901ca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlonMiz/mf-vite-angular-repro/git/trees/03859dae9510eb07c0cd14aa65c02def82901ca9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlonMiz/mf-vite-angular-repro/git/commits/bc4729b90093c500c6f26ff5340b0d897ec07d64","verification":{"payload":"tree 03859dae9510eb07c0cd14aa65c02def82901ca9\nauthor Alon Mizrahi <almizrahi@paloaltonetworks.com> 1778419528 +0300\ncommitter Alon Mizrahi <almizrahi@paloaltonetworks.com> 1778419528 +0300\n\nMinimal repro: @module-federation/vite + Angular shared deps NG0203 crash\n\nWhen the host has Angular in shared deps but the remote does not,\nthe remote bundles its own @angular/core. Two separate instances\nat runtime cause NG0203 (inject() outside injection context).\n\nRepro: npm install && npm run build && npm run preview\nOpen http://localhost:4173/remote → see NG0203 in console.\n\nToggle remote/vite.config.ts shared config between scenarios.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAARcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAEBANN4SBS4tXQurtzSfgK8Gs\noWiAFYNbrmfCVuWPvKpaVOgbhMW9iNpXH3No6B+MRVHcd8r/FcE8FZtE8IgHUsDvS7hIlu\nzxiPXd2ojA8xYNf1KF35Dc64KpNG925oPLKV8uRO0e7ZjAlqv1HgS8aGHKhlcpT1cqUSDx\ntxAlRV6OvggwEIGps2ksvMEOaJWcxI9NEOjR5VWjJ2PgrINLQVOvkHuUJEgTUjWK76S6PV\nKJI9wOdEzNzMTlpWzIX5nliq5rdGG6tmX7oSoDpuRCDS2TPl/4DZyEEL9udb9qfU+WRlyq\nPNMUJOl6NC7XF2jIHAP/YHpO1w1NjpUX4NP4qi3pcAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIA\nAAEUAAAADHJzYS1zaGEyLTUxMgAAAQBNrmn6NuG3rRC+M/1r00iTt9iB8hNyJjdAsmM4lk\np60kPmZcLXhwUZtza6oD8UDxO//dEHHQYSzESec3H/cOmmTleHVXpkcoF0yonnVEGNBt2Q\nUEvTCAOTnVujXZhkbvyyq5c8ghvN5edavbpXaN4BY0QtHp7cgA8o84Eayd/zcwCZa0jfYi\nCqlBjjxBTNyiT432hxh1uSl8QUU/5+A7PgcUOdLOGBkzmeY55UKkP3Z+dRESiimi9hxOdg\nbRyyggIhIpD7NqomuUsqqgHszMJRg3u8R1YWcxql+w6D/XqwyQlCPMTG5iNC2/IuzXvXgS\nf4+8dF4jD1ny5bczLOjZth\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"ver