T17:51:50Z","email":"hans.sagita@gmail.com","name":"hanssagita"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T17:51:50Z","email":"hans.sagita@gmail.com","name":"hanssagita"},"message":"feat: initialize microfrontend architecture with payment and shell applications\n\n- Added package.json for the root project to manage workspaces and scripts.\n- Created payment microfrontend with its own package.json, webpack configuration, and entry files.\n- Implemented payment form with state management using Zustand and integrated with shared store.\n- Added tests for payment functionality using Vitest and Testing Library.\n- Established shell application to serve as the main entry point for microfrontends, including routing and navigation.\n- Configured Module Federation for dynamic loading of microfrontends (home, checkout, payment).\n- Set up Tailwind CSS for styling in both payment and shell applications.\n- Created shared state management in a separate package for consistent user and cart state across microfrontends.","tree":{"sha":"bbbe9bce0c4f05679ef290f7da4da27be5166cff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanssagita/MFE/git/trees/bbbe9bce0c4f05679ef290f7da4da27be5166cff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanssagita/MFE/git/commits/78198495ea612886401e8555f308c9315ca5e978","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18932532?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanssagita/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanssagita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanssagita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanssagita/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hanssagita","id":18932532,"login":"hanssagita","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4OTMyNTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanssagita/orgs","received_events_url":"https://