technologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/125d9e0ef602c017e8ffade458e4698ebc56f843"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/dcb7654e03a09666cb843313a3ee86b26e3a1c30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T16:02:55Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T16:02:55Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"docs(bpmn): add 16 Mermaid BPMN workflows + standard\n\nArchitecture documentation for every core workflow, reflecting Convex\nrealtime semantics (queries / mutations / actions / scheduled fanout)\nrather than REST request chains. Each file follows a fixed 10-section\ntemplate (purpose, trigger, preconditions, swimlanes, main flow,\nalternative flows, postconditions, realtime events, AI interactions,\nmodule mapping).\n\nIndex\n- 001 visitor registration\n- 002 visitor → subscriber conversion\n- 003 subscription lifecycle\n- 004 customer feed consumption\n- 005 watchlists & tracking\n- 006 creator application & verification\n- 007 creator pick publishing\n- 008 creator livestream workflow\n- 009 creator custom event creation\n- 010 moderation & review\n- 011 fraud detection & dispute resolution\n- 012 realtime odds synchronization\n- 013 pick grading workflow\n- 014 AI intelligence pipeline\n- 015 notification orchestration\n- 016 realtime event lifecycle (architecture backbone)\n\nConventions: Mermaid flowchart TD with subgraph swimlanes, [(table)]\nfor Convex tables, {{action.name}} for actions/cron, [/External/] for\nthird parties, dotted arrows for async/scheduled fanout.\n\nPlus: incidental codegen reformatting in convex/_generated/api.d.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fe2062c288275a126c75246ba604378d2438ae9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/1fe2062c288275a126c75246ba604378d2438ae9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/dcb7654e03a09666cb843313a3ee86b26e3a1c30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"ht