ents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/e227420151aab324bbc866ee9adbd7954a6237b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T13:56:57Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T13:56:57Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat: replace Creator page with Discover, improve win rate formatting, clean up prototype files, and add comprehensive project documentation.","tree":{"sha":"f77fa6611e407dda1fa1f00855bd4f5fe08f5cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/f77fa6611e407dda1fa1f00855bd4f5fe08f5cd5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/e227420151aab324bbc866ee9adbd7954a6237b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/e227420151aab324bbc866ee9adbd7954a6237b4","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKGUyMjc0MjAxNTFhYWIzMjRiYmM4NjZlZTlhZGJkNzk1NGE2MjM3YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/4f7936e3fd24daabeb2bb9708adf061aebdf4aed","sha":"4f7936e3fd24daabeb2bb9708adf061aebdf4aed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/4f7936e3fd24daabeb2bb9708adf061aebdf4aed"}],"sha":"e227420151aab324bbc866ee9adbd7954a6237b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/e227420151aab324bbc866ee9adbd7954a6237b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/4f7936e3fd24daabeb2bb9708adf061aebdf4aed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T12:32:32Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T12:32:32Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-15): promoted creators · rate-limiter shards · server Sentry · a11y · i18n\n\nFinal round of polish — every PRD/SRSD item that was still open at MVP\nscope is now closed. Prediction battles (12e) and Playwright E2E (13c)\nremain explicitly deferred per the original architectural decision.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- schema.creators.{promotedUntil, promotedRank} + by_promoted index\n  (Phase 15a, PRD §12 revenue line \"Promoted creators\").\n- creators.promoted query — returns currently-promoted creators ordered\n  by rank desc; drives Landing rotation surface.\n- creators.setPromotion admin mutation — flips promotion on/off,\n  audit-logged.\n- shared/rateLimit.ts: shards: N on hot buckets — 8 for channelsPost,\n  4 for stripeCheckout, 4 for gdprExport. Closes NFR-005 readiness for\n  10k+ rps cumulative without bottlenecking on a single counter doc.\n- shared/sentryNode.ts (NEW): @sentry/node bootstrap + withSentry\n  helper. Wraps push.sendToUser + sources.espncricinfo.pollCricketFixtures\n  so exceptions get captured + flushed without changing retry/scheduler\n  behavior. SENTRY_DSN_NODE gates init — quiet no-op when unset.\n- subscriptionStatus already includes ''refunded'' (added Phase 14e); no\n  schema delta here.\n\nDS / a11y:\n- Sparkline: role=\"img\" + auto-generated aria-label that summarizes\n  trend direction, point count, range, and final value. WCAG 1.1.1\n  non-text content + 4.1.2 name/role/value.\n- ConfidenceGauge: role=\"meter\" + aria-valuenow/min/max/text.\n  Replaces the static aria-label hack.\n- AppHeader actions region: role=\"region\" + aria-live=\"polite\" so\n  screen readers announce notification badge updates.\n\ni18n (Phase 15e):\n- packages/shared/src/i18n/{dict,en,nb,index}.ts — typed Dictionary\n  shape (compile-time-checked dot-paths), seed translations for\n  nav/actions/notify/state surfaces. createI18n(locale) returns a t()\n  function with autocomplete on every key.\n- packages/shared/dist rebuilt so apps see the new exports.\n- apps/web/src/lib/i18n.tsx — React provider that reads the user''s\n  locale from api.users.meSafe and exposes useT() / useLocale() hooks.\n  Falls back to English for anonymous users.\n- main.tsx wires <I18nProvider> around <App /> inside the Sentry\n  boundary. Existing pages keep their hardcoded English; surfaces can\n  migrate to t(''...'') incrementally.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8 strict)\n- pnpm lint (0 errors, 13 pre-existing warnings)\n- pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 470kB → 150kB gz, +2kB for i18n provider)\n- npx convex dev --once (4.15s) — promoted creators query live\n\nSmoke check:\n- creators.promoted (no promotions set) → []  ✓\n\nCarry-forward — explicit deferrals:\n- 12e Prediction battles (needs UX design pass)\n- 12f Full i18n string sweep (scaffold landed; per-page migration is\n  follow-up work)\n- 13c Playwright E2E (needs browser fleet + Convex preview)\n- SportsDataIO redundancy / trial-day flow / fraud-rules engine —\n  secondary growth+ops, not blocking the PRD/SRSD claim\n\nNotes:\n- New env vars: SENTRY_DSN_NODE (optional), SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT\n  (optional), SENTRY_RELEASE / VITE_RELEASE (optional).\n- New rate-limiter shards reset existing counters — no migration; the\n  next request creates the sharded rows lazily.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25b1371d8af88965330abee15157d1db50813808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/25b1371d8af88965330abee15157d1db50813808"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/4f7936e3fd24daabeb2bb9708adf061aebdf4aed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/4f7936e3fd24daabeb2bb9708adf061aebdf4aed","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDRmNzkzNmUzZmQyNGRhYWJlYjJiYjk3MDhhZGYwNjFhZWJkZjRhZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/2181f44db86828ea020fa48d4ceec6e74d0d3a07","sha":"2181f44db86828ea020fa48d4ceec6e74d0d3a07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/2181f44db86828ea020fa48d4ceec6e74d0d3a07"}],"sha":"4f7936e3fd24daabeb2bb9708adf061aebdf4aed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/4f7936e3fd24daabeb2bb9708adf061aebdf4aed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/2181f44db86828ea020fa48d4ceec6e74d0d3a07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:26:12Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:26:12Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-14): cursor pagination · line-movement alerts · watchlists · reactions · refunds · grading history · stream rooms\n\nCloses the remaining items from the PRD/SRSD gap audit. Every line is\nverifiable against a spec citation: M8 line movement, M12 reactions +\nstream-linked rooms, M14 watchlists + line alerts, M15 saved library\npagination, NFR-001 cursor pagination, NFR-002 refund handling, M10\ngrading transparency.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- schema:\n  + watchlists table (filter object + isActive). Indexes:\n    by_user (createdAt), by_active.\n  + messages.reactions (Array<{ emoji, userIds }>) — null when none.\n  + channels.linkedStreamCreatorId + by_linkedStream index — Phase 14g\n    transient stream-companion rooms.\n  + subscriptionStatus +''refunded'' literal.\n\n- watchlists.ts: listMine / create / update / remove + internal\n  _matchPick. Filter semantics: shallow AND across set keys; empty\n  fields wildcard. Supports sport, league, creatorIds, market,\n  minConfidence (Low<Medium<High), access, bodyContains substring,\n  lineMoveAbovePercent (consumed by lineMovement, not pick triggers).\n\n- lineMovement.ts: pollLineMovements internalAction (hourly cron).\n  Compares latest oddsSnapshot vs first within a 6h window per\n  (event, market, book, side). When implied-probability shift ≥\n  LINE_MOVE_THRESHOLD_PCT (default 5), notify.dispatch fans out to:\n  active subscribers of any creator with a published pick on the\n  event + savedPicks owners + watchlist owners whose\n  lineMoveAbovePercent threshold is met. entityKey-deduped through\n  notify so successive small ticks don''t spam the inbox.\n\n- messages.toggleReaction mutation. Parent-access enforced\n  (channel tier gate / DM thread participant / conversation\n  participant). Empty buckets pruned so the reactions array stays\n  clean.\n\n- notify.onPickPublished now also fans an extra dispatch for every\n  watchlist whose filter matches the pick. Same entityKey as the\n  subscriber row so dedup collapses overlap into one in-app entry.\n\n- picks.feedPaginated query (Convex paginate API). picks.gradingHistory\n  query — append-only audit trail scoped to a single pickId, returned\n  ascending so the UI reads as a timeline.\n\n- picks.grade now emits an audit row with `pick.graded.<grade>` so\n  gradingHistory has data on day one.\n\n- savedPicks.listPaginated + notifications.listMinePaginated mirroring\n  the existing list / listMine queries with paginationOpts.\n\n- streams._ensureStreamRoom + fanLiveNotification call site.\n  Idempotent — re-runs reactivate the existing room.\n\n- messages.postToChannel rejects posts to stream-linked rooms when\n  the linked creator is offline.\n\n- http.ts handles charge.refunded / invoice.refunded / invoice.voided\n  → flips local subscription.status to ''refunded'' via the existing\n  _updateSubscriptionStatusFromStripe internal mutation.\n\n- crons.ts: poll-line-movements (1h) registered.\n\nFrontend (apps/web, packages/ds):\n- DS ChatPanel: reaction picker + count rendering. Optional\n  onToggleReaction handler — when omitted, reactions render read-only.\n  Quick-emoji set defaults to {👍 🔥 💯 😂 🎯 👀}; consumer can\n  override via quickEmojis prop.\n\n- pages/Community + dashboard/Messages wire the reaction handler to\n  api.messages.toggleReaction. Same code path on both sides.\n\n- account/pages/Watchlists (NEW) — full CRUD for the calling user''s\n  watchlists. Inline pause/activate switch per row, summary string\n  renders the filter dimensions, line-move threshold input.\n\nBundled with this commit (already in working tree from parallel work):\n- DS InsightCard, PortfolioHero, SubscriptionTile, StatTile,\n  SectionHead components used by the user''s account/Results dashboard\n  redesign. Included so packages/ds/src/index.ts is internally\n  consistent on a fresh checkout.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8 strict)\n- pnpm lint (0 errors, 11 pre-existing unused-import warnings)\n- pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests, no unhandled rejections)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 468kB → 149kB gz)\n- npx convex dev --once (3.67s) — 11 crons + all new functions live\n- thin-app guardrails clean\n- audit append-only grep clean\n\nSmoke checks against the live deployment:\n- watchlists.listMine (anon) → \"Unauthorized\"\n- picks.gradingHistory (any pickId) → []\n- 11 crons registered (poll-line-movements joins the list)\n\nNotes:\n- New env: LINE_MOVE_THRESHOLD_PCT (defaults to 5).\n- The 5/10 carry-forward items the audit surfaced are now ALL shipped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e990451ed7d75eec0f9d8444c1c1b2dba67ae95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/4e990451ed7d75eec0f9d8444c1c1b2dba67ae95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/2181f44db86828ea020fa48d4ceec6e74d0d3a07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/2181f44db86828ea020fa48d4ceec6e74d0d3a07","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDIxODFmNDRkYjg2ODI4ZWEwMjBmYTQ4ZDRjZWVjNmU3NGQwZDNhMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/d69afd91ac720ad10d489fedbbff61289bb2ec96","sha":"d69afd91ac720ad10d489fedbbff61289bb2ec96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/d69afd91ac720ad10d489fedbbff61289bb2ec96"}],"sha":"2181f44db86828ea020fa48d4ceec6e74d0d3a07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/2181f44db86828ea020fa48d4ceec6e74d0d3a07"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/d69afd91ac720ad10d489fedbbff61289bb2ec96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:12:30Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:12:30Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"fix(lint): scope service-worker globals so apps/web/public/sw.js passes lint\n\nEslint flat-config doesn''t honor /* eslint-env serviceworker */ comments.\nAdded a files-scoped override that whitelists the SW globals (self,\nclients, caches, skipWaiting, registration) for **/public/sw.js. Reverts\nthe temporary comment in sw.js.\n\nCI lint gate now passes from a clean checkout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e06e6bd6baae49ec5d1778e95252e86599bc2d81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/e06e6bd6baae49ec5d1778e95252e86599bc2d81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/d69afd91ac720ad10d489fedbbff61289bb2ec96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/d69afd91ac720ad10d489fedbbff61289bb2ec96","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKGQ2OWFmZDkxYWM3MjBhZDEwZDQ4OWZlZGJiZmY2MTI4OWJiMmVjOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/c18e00edc90b9732b69de51b90f4fba5e1a660d7","sha":"c18e00edc90b9732b69de51b90f4fba5e1a660d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/c18e00edc90b9732b69de51b90f4fba5e1a660d7"}],"sha":"d69afd91ac720ad10d489fedbbff61289bb2ec96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/d69afd91ac720ad10d489fedbbff61289bb2ec96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/c18e00edc90b9732b69de51b90f4fba5e1a660d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:08:03Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:08:03Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-13): Sentry · admin DisputeQueue · re-enable strict noImplicitAny\n\nRound 4 — observability + admin moderation surface + closes the\nimplicit-any FIXME from Phase 8.\n\n- main.tsx: @sentry/react boot. VITE_SENTRY_DSN gates init so dev\n  environments stay quiet. Production uses browserTracingIntegration\n  with conservative 0.1 sample rate. Sentry.ErrorBoundary wraps the\n  app tree when configured; falls through to plain render otherwise\n  so dev never sees the boundary unless DSN is set. Fallback uses DS\n  primitives (Container/Heading/Muted) — no inline styles, thin-app\n  rule respected.\n\n- pages/admin/DisputeQueue.tsx (NEW): full moderation surface wired to\n  api.disputes.queue + api.disputes.transition. Status filter\n  (Segmented), per-row Open detail, transition controls (under_review\n  / resolved / dismissed), inline resolution-note textarea. Detail\n  view also lists existing notes from the dispute.notes thread.\n  Routed under apps/web/src/pages/admin/* — wiring into AdminRoutes\n  is left to the user since they''re actively iterating that file.\n\n- apps/web/tsconfig.json: removed `noImplicitAny: false` carve-out.\n  The legacy implicit-any errors that were present at Phase 8 have\n  been resolved (combination of explicit Convex query return types\n  shipped along the way + the user''s own iterations on dashboard +\n  account pages). Strict TypeScript is now enforced everywhere.\n\n- ai.ts analyzePick: missing ANTHROPIC_API_KEY now returns\n  { skipped: true } instead of throwing. Matches the pattern used by\n  oddsApi / streams / push / telegram so the picks.create scheduler\n  chain doesn''t blow up in dev / test environments without the key.\n  Cleared the unhandled-rejection noise that was making vitest exit\n  non-zero on green test runs.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8 projects, strict mode on)\n- pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests — clean exit, no unhandled errors)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 468kB → 149kB gz)\n\nPhase 13 carry-forward queue is now empty except for:\n- 13c Playwright E2E (deferred — needs browser fleet + Convex preview)\n- AdminRoutes wire-up for /admin/disputes (user-side)\n- Wiring `MfaEnrollmentCard` into the subscriber-side account/Settings\n  alongside the existing creator-side dashboard/Settings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b85532141345d8f7f05462ec18ffd5f8e3171884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/b85532141345d8f7f05462ec18ffd5f8e3171884"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/c18e00edc90b9732b69de51b90f4fba5e1a660d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/c18e00edc90b9732b69de51b90f4fba5e1a660d7","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKGMxOGUwMGVkYzkwYjk3MzJiNjlkZTUxYjkwZjRmYmE1ZTFhNjYwZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/94103b637fc75b0290aedcb4f9ebea1931bc966c","sha":"94103b637fc75b0290aedcb4f9ebea1931bc966c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/94103b637fc75b0290aedcb4f9ebea1931bc966c"}],"sha":"c18e00edc90b9732b69de51b90f4fba5e1a660d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/c18e00edc90b9732b69de51b90f4fba5e1a660d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/94103b637fc75b0290aedcb4f9ebea1931bc966c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:04:33Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:04:33Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-13): wire DS surfaces — Follow · Trust · TrendingCarousel · AI · MFA · Referrals\n\nRound 3 ties Phase 11–12 backend to the running app. All five carry-\nforward UI surfaces ship in this commit.\n\n- pages/CreatorDetail\n  + TrustScoreBadge (sm) in the badge row, sourced from api.trust.get.\n  + FollowButton replaces the placeholder \"Save\" — wired to\n    api.followedCreators.{follow, unfollow, isFollowing}. Subscribe\n    button stays primary.\n\n- pages/Landing\n  + New TrendingPicksRail section between brand marquee and \"How it\n    works\", sourced from api.trending.trending. Skeleton loading state\n    while the cron-computed scores are missing for fresh deploys.\n\n- dashboard/pages/CreatePick\n  + AIAssistPanel above the Analysis textarea. \"Suggest\" calls\n    api.ai.suggestPick with the in-progress sketch; \"Use suggestion\"\n    fills the body field with the reasoning and maps confidence to the\n    creator-confidence enum. \"Re-roll\" kicks the action again.\n\n- dashboard/pages/Growth\n  + Replaced mocked Referrals card with live ReferralsCard wiring\n    api.referrals.{mintMyCode, myCodes}. Share link opens the new\n    ReferralShareModal with copy-to-clipboard. Stats: live code,\n    conversions, lifetime cents earned.\n\n- dashboard/pages/Settings\n  + New MfaEnrollmentCard between Verification and Privacy. Full TOTP\n    flow: enrollStart → verifySetup → status / verify / disable.\n    Local state holds the one-shot enrollment secrets so the recovery\n    codes are visible exactly once.\n\nVerification: pnpm typecheck (8/8) · pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests) ·\npnpm build (web bundle 468kB → 149kB gz, +2kB for the wired surfaces).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe83b36f92cbfca2c18be8283bcbef5c0c46c9b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/fe83b36f92cbfca2c18be8283bcbef5c0c46c9b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/94103b637fc75b0290aedcb4f9ebea1931bc966c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/94103b637fc75b0290aedcb4f9ebea1931bc966c","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDk0MTAzYjYzN2ZjNzViMDI5MGFlZGNiNGY5ZWJlYTE5MzFiYzk2NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/ec629ae8dd8c65f97acfbe026d4b4f35e3e52b4e","sha":"ec629ae8dd8c65f97acfbe026d4b4f35e3e52b4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/ec629ae8dd8c65f97acfbe026d4b4f35e3e52b4e"}],"sha":"94103b637fc75b0290aedcb4f9ebea1931bc966c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/94103b637fc75b0290aedcb4f9ebea1931bc966c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/ec629ae8dd8c65f97acfbe026d4b4f35e3e52b4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:00:48Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T22:00:48Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-13a-2): MfaEnrollmentCard · ReferralShareModal · DisputeForm\n\nRound 2 of the Phase 11–12 DS gap-fillers. Pure presentation surfaces;\nhosting pages own the api.* calls.\n\n- surfaces/MfaEnrollmentCard — three-state machine (idle / enrolling /\n  enrolled). Handles the full TOTP flow: hands the user the otpauth://\n  URI + manual secret + 10 single-use recovery codes during enrollment,\n  then surfaces last-verified relative time + low-recovery warning when\n  the badge count drops to 3.\n\n- feedback/ReferralShareModal — modal that wraps Modal with the user''s\n  referral link, copy-to-clipboard, code, and conversion stats. Caller\n  fetches code via api.referrals.mintMyCode and stats via\n  api.referrals.myCodes aggregation.\n\n- forms/DisputeForm — compact reason + detail textarea form for opening\n  a dispute on a graded pick. Inline-friendly so it can drop into an\n  expanded PickCard.\n\nAll exported from ds/index.ts. typecheck + build clean.\n69 convex tests still passing — no backend touched in this commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5443bf2c1c0f6fabd2db8dda07eb35b33f65d0a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/5443bf2c1c0f6fabd2db8dda07eb35b33f65d0a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/ec629ae8dd8c65f97acfbe026d4b4f35e3e52b4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/ec629ae8dd8c65f97acfbe026d4b4f35e3e52b4e","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKGVjNjI5YWU4ZGQ4YzY1Zjk3YWNmYmUwMjZkNGI0ZjM1ZTNlNTJiNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/d289e98e74dac72df6d15126d00a96f4bafcdaac","sha":"d289e98e74dac72df6d15126d00a96f4bafcdaac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/d289e98e74dac72df6d15126d00a96f4bafcdaac"}],"sha":"ec629ae8dd8c65f97acfbe026d4b4f35e3e52b4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/ec629ae8dd8c65f97acfbe026d4b4f35e3e52b4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/d289e98e74dac72df6d15126d00a96f4bafcdaac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:59:14Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:59:14Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-13): wire MFA gate + referral redemption + carry-forward backend\n\nCloses the backend carry-forwards from Phases 11–12 so the gates fire\non real traffic.\n\n- mfa.ts: new `gateOnMfaIfEnrolled(ctx, userId)` — soft variant of\n  requireMfaFresh that no-ops when the user hasn''t enrolled, throws\n  freshness error when they have. The right default for the gradual\n  MFA rollout: non-enrolled creators keep publishing, enrolled\n  creators get the gate transparently.\n\n- Wired gateOnMfaIfEnrolled into:\n    picks.create               (creator publishing path)\n    disputes.transition        (admin moderation path)\n    applications.review        (admin onboarding path)\n\n- Stripe webhook → referral redemption (Phase 12c finish):\n    http.ts dispatchPayout now reads metadata.referralCode +\n    metadata.userId from the subscription. On invoice.paid it computes\n    payoutCents = floor(amountPaid * 0.10) and calls\n    internal.referrals._redeem.\n    stripe.createCheckoutSession accepts an optional referralCode arg\n    and surfaces it through metadata + subscription_data.metadata so\n    the webhook sees it.\n\nVerification: pnpm typecheck (8/8) · pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests) ·\npnpm build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38f86821347737f56aedf03ac3dbd5d0e1f16701","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/38f86821347737f56aedf03ac3dbd5d0e1f16701"},"url":"