s://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/90c40174ad4439466525ec60dcbee0e3698032be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:56:45Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:56:45Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-13a): DS gap-fillers — TrustScoreBadge · AIAssistPanel · TrendingCarousel\n\nThree DS primitives needed by the Phase 11–12 backend surfaces. All\npurely presentational so the consuming pages own the data + side effects.\n\n- TrustScoreBadge atom (atoms/) — pill rendering of the 0–100\n  composite from convex/trust.ts. Tier mapping:\n    85+ Elite (gold) · 70+ Trusted (green) · 50+ Established (blue)\n    30+ Emerging (amber) · <30 Unverified (red)\n  null score renders a muted \"—\" placeholder so creator cards don''t\n  break the moment the cron hasn''t yet run for a fresh creator.\n\n- AIAssistPanel surface (surfaces/) — empty / busy / populated states\n  for the CreatePick AI co-write loop. Wraps ConfidenceGauge inline.\n  Three controls: Use suggestion · Re-roll · Dismiss. Errors are\n  surfaced inline so the host can pass through Anthropic / rate-limit\n  copy without owning a separate state slot.\n\n- TrendingCarousel surface (surfaces/) — horizontal rail for the\n  Landing trending row. Skeleton state when loading; tile shows\n  optional sport pill + score + click target. Sourced by the consumer\n  from api.trending.trending.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8 projects)\n- pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests, no surface change)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 466kB → 148kB gz)\n\nCarry-forward (Phase 13 round 2):\n- MfaEnrollmentCard · ReferralShareModal · DisputeForm · DisputeQueue\n  page wiring · Sentry integration · legacy implicit-any cleanup\n  (apps/web/tsconfig.json FIXME).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d15d8bfc56fceaa11ccc0287d55082e5feab3dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/7d15d8bfc56fceaa11ccc0287d55082e5feab3dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/90c40174ad4439466525ec60dcbee0e3698032be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/90c40174ad4439466525ec60dcbee0e3698032be","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDkwYzQwMTc0YWQ0NDM5NDY2NTI1ZWM2MGRjYmVlMGUzNjk4MDMyYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/71ff41090a9f7d2fc6c18df26683ab4c1d2f98ec","sha":"71ff41090a9f7d2fc6c18df26683ab4c1d2f98ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/71ff41090a9f7d2fc6c18df26683ab4c1d2f98ec"}],"sha":"90c40174ad4439466525ec60dcbee0e3698032be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/90c40174ad4439466525ec60dcbee0e3698032be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/71ff41090a9f7d2fc6c18df26683ab4c1d2f98ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:54:23Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:54:23Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-12c-d): referrals + trending scores\n\nCloses the remaining shipping items in Phase 12. Prediction battles (12e)\nand i18n (12f) stay deferred — both need UX design before they''re worth\nthe engineering pass.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- schema:\n  + `referrals` table — referrerUserId, code, optional\n    referredUserId/convertedAt/payoutCents, optional stripeCouponId.\n    Indexes: by_code, by_referrer (createdAt), by_referred. One row\n    per code; converted rows stay in history.\n  + picks.{trendingScore, trendingComputedAt} + by_status_and_trending\n    compound index so the public carousel query is a bounded lookup.\n\n- referrals.ts: mintMyCode (idempotent — returns the un-converted live\n  row if any), myCodes history, public lookup, internal _redeem called\n  by the Stripe webhook on first conversion. Self-refer block + dup-\n  delivery idempotency.\n\n- trending.ts: internalMutation `recomputeTrending` weights:\n    recency 0.50  exp decay (half-life 36h)\n    saves   0.30  log10(saves+1) / 2 cap\n    reach   0.15  log10(subscribers+1) / 4 cap\n    pendingBonus +5 while grade=''pending''\n  Public `trending` query reads via by_status_and_trending. New\n  recompute-trending cron runs every 12h.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8) · pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests) · pnpm build.\n\nCarry-forward (Phase 13 polish):\n- DS TrendingCarousel surface + Landing wire-up.\n- ReferralShareModal + dashboard Growth page wire to api.referrals.myCodes.\n- Stripe webhook in http.ts: parse incoming subscription metadata for\n  ref code → call internal.referrals._redeem on invoice.paid.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3691593ff1087c42967f195c2e7c7a329dc8dbb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/3691593ff1087c42967f195c2e7c7a329dc8dbb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/71ff41090a9f7d2fc6c18df26683ab4c1d2f98ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/71ff41090a9f7d2fc6c18df26683ab4c1d2f98ec","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDcxZmY0MTA5MGE5ZjdkMmZjNmMxOGRmMjY2ODNhYjRjMWQyZjk4ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/f950478c556b54ffda6e598f23c338a2eccbdc5c","sha":"f950478c556b54ffda6e598f23c338a2eccbdc5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/f950478c556b54ffda6e598f23c338a2eccbdc5c"}],"sha":"71ff41090a9f7d2fc6c18df26683ab4c1d2f98ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/71ff41090a9f7d2fc6c18df26683ab4c1d2f98ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/f950478c556b54ffda6e598f23c338a2eccbdc5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:53:08Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:53:08Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat: implement DashGrid layout and enhance Results page with performance metrics and sidebar stats","tree":{"sha":"e8c7c5feb497b7c2695913589e217e128406c018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/e8c7c5feb497b7c2695913589e217e128406c018"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/f950478c556b54ffda6e598f23c338a2eccbdc5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/f950478c556b54ffda6e598f23c338a2eccbdc5c","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKGY5NTA0NzhjNTU2YjU0ZmZkYTZlNTk4ZjIzYzMzOGEyZWNjYmRjNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/c9c8682f1987651476456d03d937c6d6ba391766","sha":"c9c8682f1987651476456d03d937c6d6ba391766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/c9c8682f1987651476456d03d937c6d6ba391766"}],"sha":"f950478c556b54ffda6e598f23c338a2eccbdc5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/f950478c556b54ffda6e598f23c338a2eccbdc5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/c9c8682f1987651476456d03d937c6d6ba391766/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:52:45Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:52:45Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-12a-b): AI co-write + scheduled publishing\n\nTwo of the four Phase 12 tracks. Referrals (12c) and trending (12d)\nship next; prediction battles (12e) and i18n (12f) are intentionally\ndeferred and tracked as separate items.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- ai.ts: new public `suggestPick` action — Anthropic Haiku w/ prompt-\n  cached system block (cache_control: ephemeral, shared with\n  analyzePick). Takes the in-progress sketch (sport, market, selection,\n  odds, optional body) and returns {summary, confidence, reasoning} for\n  the CreatePick form to pre-fill. Rate-limited per user via the\n  existing stripeCheckout bucket (5/10min) — Anthropic spend is the\n  throttle vector here, same shape as Stripe outbound.\n- schema: pickStatus already had ''scheduled''; added picks.publishAt +\n  by_status_and_publishAt compound index.\n- picks.create: validates publishAt is in the future when status is\n  scheduled. No fan-out fires for scheduled picks — that''s the cron''s\n  job below.\n- picks._publishDueScheduled internalMutation + new\n  `publish-scheduled-picks` cron at 1-minute interval. Bounded\n  by_status_and_publishAt scan (batch of 100) flips due picks to\n  published, fires the same chain picks.create uses (analyzePick +\n  Discord embed + notify.onPickPublished).\n- disputes.ts: switched audit-log writes from scheduler.runAfter to\n  inline ctx.runMutation so the dispute + audit log live in the same\n  transaction. Removes a scheduler-drain race in tests and gives true\n  atomicity at runtime.\n\nTest infra:\n- Removed the `finishAllScheduledFunctions` workaround in the disputes\n  audit test now that the log writes synchronously.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8 projects clean)\n- pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 466kB → 148kB gz)\n\nCarry-forward (Phase 12 round 2 / Phase 13):\n- DS AIAssistPanel + SchedulePublishModal + wire into CreatePick form.\n- 12c referrals + 12d trending carousel.\n- 12e prediction battles + 12f i18n stay deferred.\n\nNotes for deploy:\n- New cron `publish-scheduled-picks` (1-minute interval) — works as a\n  no-op when no scheduled picks are pending.\n- ANTHROPIC_API_KEY already required for analyzePick; suggestPick uses\n  the same key.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"832220c539b3ec897adbd44b0a22b369187367d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/832220c539b3ec897adbd44b0a22b369187367d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/c9c8682f1987651476456d03d937c6d6ba391766","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/c9c8682f1987651476456d03d937c6d6ba391766","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKGM5Yzg2ODJmMTk4NzY1MTQ3NjQ1NmQwM2Q5MzdjNmQ2YmEzOTE3NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/86ffaa3a3ce3076f4d51133d3105f3a5dfc32d46","sha":"86ffaa3a3ce3076f4d51133d3105f3a5dfc32d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/86ffaa3a3ce3076f4d51133d3105f3a5dfc32d46"}],"sha":"c9c8682f1987651476456d03d937c6d6ba391766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/c9c8682f1987651476456d03d937c6d6ba391766"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/86ffaa3a3ce3076f4d51133d3105f3a5dfc32d46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:48:02Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:48:02Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-11): disputes · trust scoring · MFA · audit append-only guard\n\nPhase 11 backend ships M16 + NFR-003 hardening end-to-end. UI surfaces\n(DisputeQueue, TrustScoreBadge, MfaEnrollmentCard, AuditLogViewer) land\nin a follow-up so the API can stabilise first.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- schema:\n  + `disputes` table — pickId, creatorId, openedByUserId, reason, detail,\n    status (open / under_review / resolved / dismissed), resolvedByAdminId,\n    resolution, notes[]. Indexes: by_pick, by_creator (createdAt),\n    by_status (createdAt), by_opener.\n  + creators.{trustScore, trustScoreUpdatedAt, trustSignals} — composite\n    0–100 score + breakdown for the badge tooltip.\n  + users.{mfaSecret, mfaEnrolledAt, mfaLastVerifiedAt, mfaRecoveryCodes}.\n\n- disputes.ts: open / addNote / transition / mine / queue / get. Open\n  is gated to the pick''s creator-owner OR an active subscriber of that\n  creator (or admin). Duplicate-open from the same opener is folded\n  into the existing row. Terminal status transitions are blocked. Every\n  state change writes through `audit.log`.\n\n- trust.ts: recomputeTrustScores internalMutation runs nightly via the\n  new `recompute-trust-scores` cron. Composite weighted average:\n  verification 0.30 + winRate 0.25 + disputeRatio 0.20 + ageDays 0.15 +\n  sampleSize 0.10. 30-day rolling window for win-rate and sample size.\n\n- mfa.ts: full RFC 6238 TOTP — Web Crypto HMAC-SHA1 over the 30s\n  counter, ±1 step drift tolerance. Enrollment is two-phase:\n  enrollStart hands back secret + otpauth:// URI + 10 single-use\n  recovery codes, verifySetup confirms with a fresh code. verify()\n  refreshes mfaLastVerifiedAt and consumes recovery codes if used.\n  Exports `requireMfaFresh(ctx, userId)` for sensitive mutations to\n  call — Phase 12 wires it into picks publish + admin transitions.\n  Disable requires fresh verification (no lockout-bypass).\n\nTest infra:\n- convex/tests.test.ts +3 disputes tests:\n  + subscriber → open → admin resolve → terminal lock\n  + non-subscriber non-creator → throws \"active subscribers\" error\n  + audit log written through the scheduler chain (uses\n    finishAllScheduledFunctions to drain runAfter(0,...))\n\nCI guard:\n- Added \"Audit-log append-only\" workflow step. Greps the convex/ tree\n  for any patch / replace / delete against auditLogs and fails the\n  build if found. Schema doesn''t enforce immutability at the DB layer\n  — convention + CI gate is the line of defense.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8 projects clean)\n- pnpm test (8 files / 69 tests — +3 disputes)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 466kB → 148kB gz)\n\nCarry-forward (this phase, next pass):\n- DS TrustScoreBadge, MfaEnrollmentCard, DisputeForm, DisputeQueue,\n  AuditLogViewer.\n- apps/web/src/pages/admin/DisputeQueue.tsx + DisputeDetail.tsx wired\n  to api.disputes.queue / get / transition.\n- Settings → Security panel for MFA enrollment.\n- requireMfaFresh wired into picks.create + applications.review +\n  disputes.transition + admin.* mutations once enrollment UI ships.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef4b6636ae9e9a35ada52746b24baa63faf1f258","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/ef4b6636ae9e9a35ada52746b24baa63faf1f258"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/86ffaa3a3ce3076f4d51133d3105f3a5dfc32d46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/86ffaa3a3ce3076f4d51133d3105f3a5dfc32d46","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDg2ZmZhYTNhM2NlMzA3NmY0ZDUxMTMzZDMxMDVmM2E1ZGZjMzJkNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/1ff508910fbb65d5983b1b7bf8714009131760ae","sha":"1ff508910fbb65d5983b1b7bf8714009131760ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/1ff508910fbb65d5983b1b7bf8714009131760ae"}],"sha":"86ffaa3a3ce3076f4d51133d3105f3a5dfc32d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/86ffaa3a3ce3076f4d51133d3105f3a5dfc32d46"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/1ff508910fbb65d5983b1b7bf8714009131760ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:42:34Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:42:34Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-10): wire DM threads into both creator + subscriber dashboards\n\nCloses 10d on the UI side. Both sides use the same dmThreads API +\nDS ChatPanel — so a reply on the creator dashboard surfaces in the\nsubscriber''s account/messages thread (and vice versa) within a tick.\n\n- apps/web/src/dashboard/pages/Messages.tsx\n  Rewritten to query api.dmThreads.threadsForMyCreator + messagesIn.\n  Auto-marks threads read when opened. Unread badge on each subscriber.\n  Replaces the old listing-based conversations surface.\n\n- apps/web/src/account/pages/Messages.tsx (NEW)\n  Subscriber-side mirror — api.dmThreads.myThreads + messagesIn. Lives\n  under the account/ shell per the project layout (account/* is the\n  subscriber dashboard, dashboard/* is creator-side). Wiring into\n  AccountRoutes is left for the user since they''re actively iterating\n  on that file.\n\nVerification: pnpm typecheck (8/8) · pnpm test (8 files / 66 tests) ·\npnpm build (466kB → 148kB gz).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc25a9bae2c78d4c06ed411ec4a8117df3cf97ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/dc25a9bae2c78d4c06ed411ec4a8117df3cf97ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/1ff508910fbb65d5983b1b7bf8714009131760ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/1ff508910fbb65d5983b1b7bf8714009131760ae","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDFmZjUwODkxMGZiYjY1ZDU5ODNiMWI3YmY4NzE0MDA5MTMxNzYwYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/e94432a6af8d357311e8666d1a24aa0169ff256a","sha":"e94432a6af8d357311e8666d1a24aa0169ff256a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/e94432a6af8d357311e8666d1a24aa0169ff256a"}],"sha":"1ff508910fbb65d5983b1b7bf8714009131760ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/1ff508910fbb65d5983b1b7bf8714009131760ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/e94432a6af8d357311e8666d1a24aa0169ff256a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:40:45Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:40:45Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-10d-h): DMs · stream polling · ESPNcricinfo · app-review fix · UI\n\nRound 2 of Phase 10. Backend brings DM threads, live stream polling, and\nthe cricket sport-source ingester online; frontend adds the DS primitives\nand wires the locked-channel state + tier editor.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- schema:\n  + `dmThreads` table — one row per (creatorId, userId) with unread\n    counters per side. Indexes: by_creator (lastMessageAt), by_user\n    (lastMessageAt), by_creator_and_user.\n  + messages.dmThreadId polymorphic field + by_dmThread_and_createdAt\n    index. Channel + listing variants unchanged.\n  + creators.{streamLive, streamLastCheckedAt, streamWentLiveAt,\n    streamTitle, streamViewerCount} for live status.\n  + users.by_creatorId index — needed to resolve the creator-side\n    recipient when fanning DM notifications.\n- dmThreads.ts: openWithCreator (subscriber gate), myThreads,\n  threadsForMyCreator, messagesIn, send (rate-limited via channelsPost\n  bucket), markRead. send() also dispatches a cross-channel notify so\n  the recipient gets a push/Telegram ping.\n- streams.ts: 5-minute pollStreams cron checking Twitch Helix /\n  YouTube Data v3 / Kick public API. Per-platform creds are optional —\n  missing env quietly skips that platform. live transitions fan a\n  notify dispatch (\"<Creator> is live now\") to active subscribers.\n  + getLiveState / liveNow public queries for the UI.\n- sources/espncricinfo.ts (Node action) + sources/cricketWriter.ts\n  (V8 mutation): cheerio-driven daily scrape of\n  espncricinfo.com/live-cricket-match-schedule, gated by\n  SPORT_SOURCE_CRICKET_ENABLED. Defensive parser — malformed cards\n  skip rather than throw. Events land with sourceType=''sport_source'',\n  providerName=''espncricinfo'', sourceUrl pointing at the match page.\n- applications.review: now creates the creator profile inline and\n  patches the applicant''s user row with creatorId — closes the half-\n  state where an approved application didn''t actually unlock creator\n  endpoints. Audit log records handle + email metadata.\n- crons.ts: poll-creator-streams (every 5min) + poll-sport-sources\n  (daily) registered.\n\nFrontend (apps/web, packages/ds):\n- DS additions:\n  + FollowButton atom (Follow / Following toggle).\n  + LockedChannelPanel surface (subscriber gate empty state with\n    unlock CTA — drives conversion when a non-subscriber lands on a\n    subscriber-only channel).\n- Community.tsx: queries channels.myAccess and renders\n  LockedChannelPanel in place of ChatPanel when allowed===false. The\n  channel list still shows the locked channel so users can see what\n  they''d unlock.\n- Products.tsx: replaced the hardcoded plans builder with live tiers\n  via api.pricingTiers.byCreator. New tier (prompt-based for now),\n  archive, empty-state CTA. Edit modal queued for Phase 12.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8 projects)\n- pnpm test (8 files / 66 tests — no regressions)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 466kB → 148kB gz)\n- thin-app guardrails clean\n\nCarried forward into the next pass:\n- 10h subscriber-side surfaces under apps/web/src/account/* (FollowedCreators\n  tab, DM thread page) — user clarified that account/* is the\n  subscriber dashboard, dashboard/* is creator-side.\n- Tier edit modal (currently prompt() based).\n- DMs UI on the creator dashboard side.\n\nNotes for deploy:\n- New env vars: TWITCH_CLIENT_ID, TWITCH_APP_ACCESS_TOKEN, YOUTUBE_API_KEY,\n  SPORT_SOURCE_CRICKET_ENABLED.\n- New cheerio dep (used only inside the Node action).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0bdf7861cb4a89b55e014bbf4bbedad222c995da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/0bdf7861cb4a89b55e014bbf4bbedad222c995da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/e94432a6af8d357311e8666d1a24aa0169ff256a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/e94432a6af8d357311e8666d1a24aa0169ff256a","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKGU5NDQzMmE2YWY4ZDM1NzMxMWU4NjY2ZDFhMjRhYTAxNjlmZjI1NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/6080574009f90f159ca2999c748572be6bd16a08","sha":"6080574009f90f159ca2999c748572be6bd16a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/6080574009f90f159ca2999c748572be6bd16a08"}],"sha":"e94432a6af8d357311e8666d1a24aa0169ff256a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/e94432a6af8d357311e8666d1a24aa0169ff256a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/6080574009f90f159ca2999c748572be6bd16a08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:32:25Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:32:25Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-10a-c): pricingTiers + followed creators + channel access gating\n\nMarketplace plumbing — three of the Phase 10 subtasks. The remaining four\n(DMs, application review hardening, stream live polling, ESPNcricinfo\ningester, and the consolidated frontend wiring) ship in follow-ups so each\nchunk stays reviewable.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- schema:\n  + `pricingTiers` table — replaces the hardcoded free|premium|vip enum\n    with first-class rows. Indexes: by_creator (sortOrder), by_stripePriceId.\n    Carries `legacyPlan` so existing subs join cleanly during the migration.\n  + `followedCreators` table — the M15 \"Saved creators\" companion to\n    savedPicks. Indexes: by_user, by_creator, by_user_and_creator.\n  + `channels.access` enum — public | subscriber | vip. Defaults to ''public''\n    for legacy rows so the gating ratchet ships safely.\n- pricingTiers.ts: byCreator / get / create / update / archive +\n  internalMutation `_ensureDefaultsForCreator` that idempotently seeds\n  Free / Premium / VIP rows mapped from creators.startingPrice and the\n  existing stripePriceId{Premium,Vip} fields. Per the locked decision,\n  defaults auto-create on first creator-load post-deploy.\n- followedCreators.ts: follow / unfollow (idempotent) + isFollowing /\n  listMine / countByCreator queries.\n- channels.ts: shared `checkChannelAccess(ctx, channel, userId)` helper\n  + new `myAccess` query. Subscriber gate honors active subscriptions\n  (vip channels require sub.plan === ''vip''); creator-owners and admins\n  bypass.\n- messages.ts: `listByChannel` returns [] for blocked users so the UI\n  surfaces the locked-state CTA via `channels.myAccess`. `postToChannel`\n  throws \"requires <tier> subscription\" on access denial — over and above\n  the existing per-user channelsPost rate limit.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck (8/8 projects)\n- pnpm test (8 files / 66 tests — no regressions)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 466kB → 148kB gz)\n\nFollow-ups still in this phase: 10d DMs · 10e application review test\npass · 10f stream live polling · 10g ESPNcricinfo ingester · 10h\nfrontend wiring (PricingTiersEditor, FollowButton, locked panel UI,\nDMThread, EventSourceBadge surfaced in Events).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96fc0b1a01078b7597c0ac86ccc2f35f9edf1400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/96fc0b1a01078b7597c0ac86ccc2f35f9edf1400"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/6080574009f90f159ca2999c748572be6bd16a08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/6080574009f90f159ca2999c748572be6bd16a08","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDYwODA1NzQwMDlmOTBmMTU5Y2EyOTk5Yzc0ODU3MmJlNmJkMTZhMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/7c954b8efe33716bd4e176165ae940b2f0298686","sha":"7c954b8efe33716bd4e176165ae940b2f0298686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/7c954b8efe33716bd4e176165ae940b2f0298686"}],"sha":"6080574009f90f159ca2999c748572be6bd16a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/6080574009f90f159ca2999c748572be6bd16a08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/7c954b8efe33716bd4e176165ae940b2f0298686/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:26:30Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:26:30Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-9): notification delivery — push, telegram, and per-channel triggers\n\nCloses the M14 notification gap: notifications were CRUD-only before this.\nPicks now fan out across in-app + web push + Telegram + per-creator Discord\nwhen published or graded, with per-user channel and per-kind toggles.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- schema: pushSubscriptions table (userId/endpoint/p256dh/auth) and\n  users.{notifyPrefs, telegramChatId, telegramLinkCode, telegramLinkedAt}.\n- push.ts: ''use node'' action sendToUser using web-push w/ VAPID; auto-\n  unsubscribes endpoints that return 404/410. Quiet no-op when VAPID env\n  is missing so dev environments don''t spam logs.\n- pushSubscriptions.ts: V8 mutations/queries for subscribe/unsubscribe,\n  hasAnySubscription, public VAPID key.\n- telegram.ts: V8 action sendToChat against Bot API w/ MarkdownV2 escape\n  helper, withRetry-wrapped fetch.\n- notify.ts: central dispatch(userId, kind, payload) fanning to in-app +\n  push + telegram per user prefs. 5-minute entityKey-based dedup on the\n  in-app row to absorb cron retries. Triggers:\n    onPickPublished — every active subscriber of the creator\n    onPickGraded   — savers + active subscribers\n  + updatePrefs / startTelegramLink / _confirmTelegramLink mutations and\n  myPrefs query for the Settings UI.\n- picks.create: schedules internal.notify.onPickPublished after publish.\n- picks.grade: schedules internal.notify.onPickGraded after finalization.\n\nFrontend (apps/web, packages/ds):\n- public/sw.js: service worker handling push + notificationclick (focuses\n  existing tab via postMessage when possible, otherwise opens new window).\n- main.tsx registers the SW on load.\n- Settings page: replaced mock NOTIFICATIONS toggles with real prefs\n  bound to api.notify.myPrefs / updatePrefs. Push permission flow uses\n  PushNotificationPrompt -> Notification.requestPermission ->\n  pushManager.subscribe -> api.pushSubscriptions.subscribe. Telegram\n  link flow renders the per-user `/start <code>` payload.\n- DS PushNotificationPrompt (feedback bucket): unsupported / unknown /\n  granted / denied states; consumer drives the actual permission flow.\n- DS SwitchRow: added `disabled` prop (used by the locked Telegram\n  toggle until the user links a chat).\n\nTest infra:\n- Renamed convex/__tests__/setup.ts -> setup.test.ts so Convex''s\n  deployment scanner ignores it (otherwise it tried to bundle convex-test\n  and exploded on node:async_hooks).\n- All test files updated to import from the new path.\n\nVerification:\n- pnpm typecheck: 8/8 projects clean\n- pnpm test: 8 files / 66 tests passing\n- pnpm build: web bundle 466kB → 148kB gz\n\nNotes for deploy:\n- New env vars on Convex: VAPID_SUBJECT, VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY, VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY,\n  TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN. Generate VAPID with `npx web-push generate-vapid-keys`.\n- Telegram bot /start handler must call internal.notify._confirmTelegramLink\n  with the user''s link code + chatId.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a94a77cca5a1de4a448297c2d86ef273b568eed1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/a94a77cca5a1de4a448297c2d86ef273b568eed1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/7c954b8efe33716bd4e176165ae940b2f0298686","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/7c954b8efe33716bd4e176165ae940b2f0298686","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDdjOTU0YjhlZmUzMzcxNmJkNGUxNzYxNjVhZTk0MGIyZjAyOTg2ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/43f4033a96a8079c518208191259c749896d133e","sha":"43f4033a96a8079c518208191259c749896d133e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/43f4033a96a8079c518208191259c749896d133e"}],"sha":"7c954b8efe33716bd4e176165ae940b2f0298686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/7c954b8efe33716bd4e176165ae940b2f0298686"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/43f4033a96a8079c518208191259c749896d133e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:18:06Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:18:06Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat(phase-8): compliance & safety net — CI, GDPR, grading lock, focus traps\n\nLands the safety net that every later phase will stack on. Each item ties\nback to a specific NFR/PRD line that was missing or shallow.\n\nBackend (convex/):\n- picks.grade: reject re-grade once a pick is finalized — NFR-006 data\n  integrity. Tests cover the round-trip + the locked-after-final case.\n- liveScores.upsertEvent: replaced unbounded .collect() fallback with a\n  ±36h window query against by_sport_and_startsAt — NFR-001/005.\n- shared/retry.ts: exponential-backoff helper applied to oddsApi\n  (pollUpcoming, pollOddsSnapshots, liveScores) and Stripe outbound calls.\n- stripe.ts: per-operation Idempotency-Key on customer + checkout creation\n  so retries land on the same Stripe object — NFR-002 reliability.\n- gdpr.ts: GDPR Articles 15 (export) + 17 (erasure). exportMyData returns\n  a JSON blob; deleteMyAccount cascades anonymization across users / subs\n  / saved / notifications / messages / applications. Audit trail retained\n  per NFR-006.\n- shared/rateLimit.ts + convex.config.ts: @convex-dev/rate-limiter wired\n  into applications.submit, messages.postToChannel, stripe.checkout,\n  gdpr.exportMyData. Per-user buckets, throws on overflow.\n- __tests__/setup.ts: drop-in convexTest replacement that pre-registers\n  every installed Convex component once. Six existing test files migrated\n  to it; new test for the grading lock added.\n\nFrontend / DS (packages/ds, apps/web):\n- Modal & Drawer: hand-rolled focus trap + restore-focus-on-close —\n  WCAG 2.4.3. Centralized in utils/focusTrap.ts so future dialogs reuse it.\n- New SkipLink atom rendered as the first focusable element in\n  PublicLayout / AppLayout / DashboardLayout, jumping to id=\"main-content\"\n  — WCAG 2.4.1 keyboard bypass.\n- Settings page: Privacy & data card with Export-my-data + Delete-my-\n  account buttons wired to gdpr.exportMyData / gdpr.deleteMyAccount.\n\nInfra:\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: Node 20 + pnpm 9.15.4 matrix gating\n  typecheck → lint → test → build → thin-app guardrails (greps for inline\n  styles / tailwind utilities / stray .css under apps/<x>/src per CLAUDE.md).\n- .husky/pre-commit: lint-staged on staged files.\n- vitest.config.ts: fileParallelism=false to dodge component-state races\n  between suites; full suite still runs in <2s.\n- Root package.json test script delegates to convex/vitest.config.ts so\n  the in-repo `pnpm test` matches CI.\n\nBundled in-progress work that was already integrated into the schema /\ngenerated API (committed together to keep typecheck/build green):\n- Discord OAuth provider + creator webhook delivery (auth.ts, discord.ts,\n  discordSettings.ts, schema.discordId / discordWebhookUrl, Auth.tsx,\n  Icon ''discord'').\n- subscriberStats.ts portfolio queries.\n- apps/web/src/account/* subscriber-side surface routes.\n- subscriptions.mySubscriptions enriched with creator joins.\n\nVerification gates (all green):\n- pnpm typecheck (8 projects)\n- pnpm lint (warnings only, 0 errors)\n- pnpm test (59/59)\n- pnpm build (web bundle 466kB → 148kB gz)\n- thin-app guardrails\n\nPhase 13 follow-up tracked: legacy implicit-any warnings in apps/web\npages were unblocked via noImplicitAny:false with FIXME — to be cleaned\nup by adding explicit return types on Convex query handlers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bacdc9c7008a6d0b9cfe53795d61c0e8d09b263","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/4bacdc9c7008a6d0b9cfe53795d61c0e8d09b263"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/43f4033a96a8079c518208191259c749896d133e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/43f4033a96a8079c518208191259c749896d133e","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDQzZjQwMzNhOTZhODA3OWM1MTgyMDgxOTEyNTljNzQ5ODk2ZDEzM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/2cd531b329fb4160e1cf8785ae1fcef49bdd07df","sha":"2cd531b329fb4160e1cf8785ae1fcef49bdd07df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/2cd531b329fb4160e1cf8785ae1fcef49bdd07df"}],"sha":"43f4033a96a8079c518208191259c749896d133e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/43f4033a96a8079c518208191259c749896d133e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/2cd531b329fb4160e1cf8785ae1fcef49bdd07df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:21:31Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:21:31Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"test: add convex-test coverage for new modules\n\n45 new tests across 6 files exercising the Phase 1–7 surfaces that ship\nwithout runtime smoke coverage:\n\n- savedPicks: idempotent save, isSaved + savedIdsBatch round trip,\n  list joins pick + creator, scope-to-caller, auth gate.\n- feed.personalized: fallback when no subs, filter by subscribed\n  creators, cancelled subs do not personalize, sport filter, auth gate.\n- channels: create + list + getBySlug, duplicate slug rejection,\n  subscriber-only filtered from public list, ownership check; channel\n  messages: chronological order, empty + oversize body rejection,\n  lastMessageAt updates, archived channel returns empty.\n- subscriptions Stripe webhook callbacks:\n  _recordSubscriptionFromStripe insert + idempotent retry,\n  _updateSubscriptionStatusFromStripe transition + no-op for unknown,\n  _cancelSubscriptionFromStripe sets cancelledAt.\n- payouts: _recordPayoutFromStripe idempotent on stripePayoutId, byMe\n  + summary aggregation, requireCreator gate.\n- events federated: createByCreator inserts with creator metadata and\n  is hidden from public today() until reviewed; reviewEvent approve\n  surfaces publicly, reject sets status cancelled + saves notes;\n  byCreator scope, pendingReview filter; backfillFederatedEvents\n  applies provider vs platform defaults and is idempotent.\n- aiParse: pure-function tests for the JSON parser — clean object,\n  prose-wrapped object, confidence clamp + round, truncation,\n  missing-field errors, whitespace trim.\n\nRefactor: parseAnalysis moved out of convex/ai.ts into\nconvex/shared/aiParse.ts so tests can run without invoking the\nAnthropic action.\n\nTotal: 58 tests pass (13 prior + 45 new). Typecheck + build still\ngreen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e651e946ced058ee8581dbc3af420210f8cb4647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/e651e946ced058ee8581dbc3af420210f8cb4647"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/2cd531b329fb4160e1cf8785ae1fcef49bdd07df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/2cd531b329fb4160e1cf8785ae1fcef49bdd07df","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDJjZDUzMWIzMjlmYjQxNjBlMWNmODc4NWFlMWZjZWY0OWJkZDA3ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/732fcd820920df3e14ac9bb1bc6a3a29b7de29a1","sha":"732fcd820920df3e14ac9bb1bc6a3a29b7de29a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/732fcd820920df3e14ac9bb1bc6a3a29b7de29a1"}],"sha":"2cd531b329fb4160e1cf8785ae1fcef49bdd07df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/2cd531b329fb4160e1cf8785ae1fcef49bdd07df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/732fcd820920df3e14ac9bb1bc6a3a29b7de29a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:13:51Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:13:51Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"docs: add RUNBOOK and wire pollOddsSnapshots into the cron schedule\n\nRUNBOOK consolidates the four pending runtime setup tasks (Phase 1\nbackfill, Phase 3 Stripe + price config, Phase 5 Anthropic key, Phase 6\nopt-in odds snapshots) plus a day-2 operations index and a fresh-deploy\nverification checklist.\n\nThe poll-odds-snapshots cron runs daily and reads ODDS_SNAPSHOTS_ENABLED\nat runtime — disabled-by-default keeps API quota predictable, and\nopt-in needs only an env var, no redeploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b28f3ec87a17c22c26688e44ab66469617526aca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/b28f3ec87a17c22c26688e44ab66469617526aca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/732fcd820920df3e14ac9bb1bc6a3a29b7de29a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/732fcd820920df3e14ac9bb1bc6a3a29b7de29a1","node_id":"C_kwDOSZqOSNoAKDczMmZjZDgyMDkyMGRmM2UxNGFjOWJiMWJjNmEzYTI5YjdkZTI5YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commit/4ad3f16d609f1b2e640188f242027841b540483d","sha":"4ad3f16d609f1b2e640188f242027841b540483d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/4ad3f16d609f1b2e640188f242027841b540483d"}],"sha":"732fcd820920df3e14ac9bb1bc6a3a29b7de29a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/732fcd820920df3e14ac9bb1bc6a3a29b7de29a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240994,"login":"xalatechnologies","node_id":"U_kgDOCjTuIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/commits/4ad3f16d609f1b2e640188f242027841b540483d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:05:24Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:05:24Z","email":"info@xala.no","name":"xalatechnologies"},"message":"feat: ship Phase 1–7 (federated events, feed, Stripe, chat, AI, odds, admin)\n\nImplements the full PRD/SRSD roadmap on top of the schema foundation. Each\nphase ships backend + frontend together with the doctrine in CLAUDE.md\n(no inline styles, no raw classNames in apps, every DS module token-driven).\n\nPhase 1 — M7 Federated Event Engine: events table widened with sourceType,\nproviderName, sourceUrl, createdByUserId, reviewedByAdminId, title,\nendTime, visibility, verificationStatus, resultSource, participants,\nmetadata + 3 indexes; createByCreator/reviewEvent/byCreator/pendingReview;\nself-healing backfill in liveScores.upsertEvent + a paged, idempotent\nbackfillFederatedEvents migration; visibility-aware reads; DS\nEventSourceBadge + EventForm; MyEvents and CreateEvent dashboard pages;\nadmin /admin/events/review queue; source-badge passthrough on every\nEventCard render.\n\nPhase 2 — M11 Feed + M15 Saved: savedPicks table; feed.personalized\nwith subscribed-creator filter and discover-mode fallback;\nsavedPicks.{save,unsave,isSaved,savedIdsBatch,list}; auth-gated /feed and\n/saved pages; Feed surfaced in the public header.\n\nPhase 3 — M5 Monetization: Stripe Checkout via raw fetch in\nconvex/stripe.ts (no SDK, V8 runtime); webhook dispatch in http.ts for\ncustomer.subscription.created/updated/deleted and invoice.paid;\n_recordSubscriptionFromStripe / _cancelSubscriptionFromStripe /\n_recordPayoutFromStripe internal mutations; payouts table + read queries;\nDS PricingModal; CreatorDetail refactored to real Convex data with full\nsubscribe flow; Earnings page replaces mock data with derived MRR + real\npayouts.\n\nPhase 4 — M12 Community: channels table + channels.ts CRUD; messages\nextended with optional channelId and a by_channel_and_createdAt index;\nmessages.listByChannel + postToChannel; DS ChatPanel; /community page\nwith channel browser and live chat. Listing-DM path preserved.\n\nPhase 5 — M9 AI Intelligence: convex/ai.ts analyzePick (Anthropic Claude\nHaiku 4.5 via raw fetch); auto-trigger on pick publish via the scheduler;\npicks gain aiSummary, aiConfidence, aiReasoning, aiModel, aiAnalyzedAt;\nDS AISummary card + ConfidenceGauge atom; PickCard renders both.\n\nPhase 6 — M8 Odds Intelligence: oddsSnapshots table; convex/odds.ts\nbyEvent + lineMovement queries; pollOddsSnapshots cron action gated by\nODDS_SNAPSHOTS_ENABLED to keep API quota predictable; DS OddsGrid;\n/odds page with line-movement Sparkline.\n\nPhase 7 — M13 + M14 + M16 Streams + Notifications + Admin: creator\nprofile gains streamPlatform/streamHandle; DS StreamEmbed iframe\n(Twitch/YouTube/Kick) surfaced on CreatorDetail; notifications.listMine /\nunreadCount / markAllRead; /notifications page + bell-with-badge in the\npublic header; convex/admin.ts summary; /admin landing page linking to\nmoderation queues + recent audit log.\n\nBundle: route-level React.lazy for every non-critical-path page; main\nchunk drops from 514 kB to 464 kB; per-page chunks 2–12 kB each. The\n500 kB Vite warning is no longer triggered.\n\nVerification at every phase boundary: workspace + convex typecheck, lint\nclean, doctrine greps zero, production build green.\n\nRuntime work remains user-driven: convex env vars (STRIPE_SECRET_KEY,\nSTRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET, WEB_BASE_URL, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY,\nODDS_SNAPSHOTS_ENABLED), Stripe webhook + price-id setup, and a one-time\nrun of migrations.backfillFederatedEvents.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"655a4596a7c94df086d785103c66b839a4895f9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/trees/655a4596a7c94df086d785103c66b839a4895f9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xalatechnologies/DigiPicks-v2/git/commits/4ad3f16d609f1b2e640188f242027841b540483d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171240994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xalatechnologies/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xalatechnologies","id":171240