//avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134276149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev","id":134276149,"login":"Pack-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCADkNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/983e0f8d5660e81efc96c8b8d036759dd1967467/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:07:25Z","email":"nareupong.work@gmail.com","name":"Pack-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T10:07:25Z","email":"nareupong.work@gmail.com","name":"Pack-dev"},"message":"test: fix lingering ? placeholder in admin_test.go\n\nCaught during the first end-to-end run of the test suite against the new\ndockerized Postgres:\n\n  TestAdmin_DeleteUserCascades:\n    count boards: ERROR: syntax error at end of input (SQLSTATE 42601)\n\nA single SELECT was still using the SQLite-style `?` placeholder. Switched\nto $1 for Postgres positional binding. All other tests already use $1\npositional placeholders (or the admin handler endpoints, which don''t\ntouch SQL directly).\n\nResult with fix:\n  internal/auth       88.9%\n  internal/handlers   79.7%   (above the 76% threshold)\n  internal/middleware 48.3%\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98308684b52ee0527e6aa7b09fe90a2c67840cc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/git/trees/98308684b52ee0527e6aa7b09fe90a2c67840cc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/git/commits/983e0f8d5660e81efc96c8b8d036759dd1967467","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134276149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev","id":134276149,"login":"Pack-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCADkNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commit/983e0f8d5660e81efc96c8b8d036759dd1967467","node_id":"C_kwDOSaFNpdoAKDk4M2UwZjhkNTY2MGU4MWVmYzk2YzhiOGQwMzY3NTlkZDE5Njc0Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commit/9b4f5b1a4541f3c93c085c08056fa088339e1249","sha":"9b4f5b1a4541f3c93c085c08056fa088339e1249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/9b4f5b1a4541f3c93c085c08056fa088339e1249"}],"sha":"983e0f8d5660e81efc96c8b8d036759dd1967467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/983e0f8d5660e81efc96c8b8d036759dd1967467"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134276149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev","id":134276149,"login":"Pack-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCADkNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/9b4f5b1a4541f3c93c085c08056fa088339e1249/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:56:24Z","email":"nareupong.work@gmail.com","name":"Pack-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:56:24Z","email":"nareupong.work@gmail.com","name":"Pack-dev"},"message":"refactor!: swap SQLite for Postgres (pgx/v5)\n\nMigrates the entire data layer from modernc.org/sqlite to\ngithub.com/jackc/pgx/v5 via the database/sql-compatible stdlib driver.\n\nSchema:\n- BIGSERIAL primary keys instead of INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT.\n- DOUBLE PRECISION for `position` (was REAL).\n- users.created_at is now TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW() (was DATETIME default\n  CURRENT_TIMESTAMP); all other timestamp columns stay TEXT carrying\n  application-supplied RFC 3339 strings via nowISO().\n- ON DELETE CASCADE syntax unchanged; Postgres enforces FKs natively so\n  the SQLite-only foreign_keys(1) pragma is dropped.\n- ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS replaces the SQLite \"duplicate\n  column\" string-match tolerance.\n\nQuery layer:\n- All `?` placeholders → `$N` positional placeholders.\n- `INSERT … RETURNING id` + `QueryRow().Scan(&id)` replaces `LastInsertId()`.\n- `INSERT OR IGNORE INTO card_labels …` → `INSERT … ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING`.\n- Unique-violation check is now SQLSTATE 23505 via pgconn.PgError, not a\n  message-substring scrape.\n- Dynamic UPDATEs share a small setBuilder helper that numbers placeholders.\n\nConfig:\n- DB_PATH env var is gone; DATABASE_URL is now required.\n- Failure to set it fails fast with a clear message.\n\nTests:\n- Each test gets its own Postgres schema (`test_<random>`) via SetMaxOpenConns(1)\n  + `SET search_path`. t.Cleanup drops the schema CASCADE.\n- TEST_DATABASE_URL unset → tests skip (so `go test ./...` syntax-only checks\n  still pass without a running Postgres).\n- Migrate() is now exported so tests can call it on an already-pinned conn.\n\nDocker:\n- Dockerfile no longer creates /data (storage is external Postgres now).\n- Container is fully stateless.\n\nThe companion docker-compose.yml in kanban-control-panel will add a `postgres`\nservice in a follow-up commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce9b669799d7975dc2c32ed17ab12e39ddf7053e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/git/trees/ce9b669799d7975dc2c32ed17ab12e39ddf7053e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/git/commits/9b4f5b1a4541f3c93c085c08056fa088339e1249","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134276149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev","id":134276149,"login":"Pack-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCADkNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commit/9b4f5b1a4541f3c93c085c08056fa088339e1249","node_id":"C_kwDOSaFNpdoAKDliNGY1YjFhNDU0MWYzYzkzYzA4NWMwODA1NmZhMDg4MzM5ZTEyNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commit/6548db3f417f136aa3aac151a4fcaefcfa4dd946","sha":"6548db3f417f136aa3aac151a4fcaefcfa4dd946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/6548db3f417f136aa3aac151a4fcaefcfa4dd946"}],"sha":"9b4f5b1a4541f3c93c085c08056fa088339e1249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/9b4f5b1a4541f3c93c085c08056fa088339e1249"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134276149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev","id":134276149,"login":"Pack-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCADkNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/6548db3f417f136aa3aac151a4fcaefcfa4dd946/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:42:50Z","email":"nareupong.work@gmail.com","name":"Pack-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:42:50Z","email":"nareupong.work@gmail.com","name":"Pack-dev"},"message":"build: add Dockerfile for production deployment\n\nMulti-stage build:\n- build: golang:1.25-alpine, CGO disabled (modernc.org/sqlite is pure Go),\n  produces a stripped static binary at /app/server.\n- runtime: alpine:3.20 (not distroless) so the data dir can be chown''d and\n  busybox wget is available for the compose healthcheck.\n\nRuns as non-root user `app`. The SQLite data directory lives at /data (volume\nmount target) and is owned by `app`; the backend''s existing os.MkdirAll on\nthe DB_PATH parent handles first-boot.\n\nEnv defaults inside the image:\n  PORT=8080\n  DB_PATH=/data/app.db\n  CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8080  (override in compose for other origins)\n\nJWT_SECRET must be supplied at runtime (no default — the server fails fast\nif it''s missing).\n\nCompanion docker-compose lives in the kanban-control-panel repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c33acb09f26a482177eafb0baf70980c4dee7adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/git/trees/c33acb09f26a482177eafb0baf70980c4dee7adf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/git/commits/6548db3f417f136aa3aac151a4fcaefcfa4dd946","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134276149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev","id":134276149,"login":"Pack-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCADkNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commit/6548db3f417f136aa3aac151a4fcaefcfa4dd946","node_id":"C_kwDOSaFNpdoAKDY1NDhkYjNmNDE3ZjEzNmFhM2FhYzE1MWE0ZmNhZWZjZmE0ZGQ5NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commit/e8c60c2d71b81359de095215fb6476de69577f1c","sha":"e8c60c2d71b81359de095215fb6476de69577f1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/e8c60c2d71b81359de095215fb6476de69577f1c"}],"sha":"6548db3f417f136aa3aac151a4fcaefcfa4dd946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/6548db3f417f136aa3aac151a4fcaefcfa4dd946"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134276149?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pack-dev","id":134276149,"login":"Pack-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOCADkNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pack-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/commits/e8c60c2d71b81359de095215fb6476de69577f1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:27:13Z","email":"nareupong.work@gmail.com","name":"Pack-dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T09:27:13Z","email":"nareupong.work@gmail.com","name":"Pack-dev"},"message":"feat: initial kanban backend (Phase 1)\n\nGo + Gin + SQLite REST API for a kanban board app with JWT auth and global\nRBAC (admin/user). Phase 1 complete (M0–M7 per doc/spec.md in the control-panel\nrepo).\n\nSurface:\n- Auth: register / login / logout. First registered user becomes admin atomically.\n- Boards / columns / cards CRUD, cross-column drag-move via PUT /api/cards/:id.\n- Labels (per-board) with same-board attach enforcement.\n- Checklist items per card (`done` is int 0/1 over the wire).\n- Hydrated GET /api/boards/:id returns the full nested tree.\n- Admin endpoints: list users, change role, delete user, list all boards.\n\nConventions:\n- Cross-user / cross-board violations → 404 (no existence leak).\n- RBAC role denial → 403 (deliberate deviation; the URL is well-known).\n- Empty-body PUT → 400.\n- All deletes cascade through SQLite FKs (foreign_keys=1 in DSN is load-bearing).\n- Migrations on startup: CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS + additive ALTER TABLE pass\n  (used to add users.role to pre-RBAC DBs).\n\nTests cover ~82% of internal/handlers including cross-user 404, cross-board 404,\nadmin role gating, self-protection (admins can''t demote / delete themselves),\nand cascade delete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c486693e5232e19021b396f01fb6d269fb498ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pack-dev/kanban-backend/git/trees/6c486693e5232e