AwN2Q1N2I0MjNhNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commit/f8286a8597015e4cfd6695c29728c99a3ac01182","sha":"f8286a8597015e4cfd6695c29728c99a3ac01182","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/f8286a8597015e4cfd6695c29728c99a3ac01182"}],"sha":"b29a14be890ff147c4e007a5d1e007d57b423a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/b29a14be890ff147c4e007a5d1e007d57b423a67"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/f8286a8597015e4cfd6695c29728c99a3ac01182/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T02:59:09Z","email":"mathewharvey@gmai.com","name":"Mathew Harvey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T02:59:09Z","email":"mathewharvey@gmai.com","name":"Mathew Harvey"},"message":"Add calendar-style cadence picker and consolidate family-timezone clock.\n\nReplaces the cramped CadenceEditor in /admin/chores with a three-tab\nDay / Week / Month picker (tap-paint chips and a 1-31 mini calendar)\nplus a live \"Next 5 runs\" preview. Built on a new src/lib/time.ts\nthat wraps board.now + family.timezone so DueHint, TVMode \"today\",\nHistoryDesktop custom ranges, the kanban header, and the payout pill\nall evaluate the same family-TZ instant instead of drifting against\nthe viewer''s browser clock.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"830904959c363d7369266553d7570df1d4d46310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/git/trees/830904959c363d7369266553d7570df1d4d46310"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/git/commits/f8286a8597015e4cfd6695c29728c99a3ac01182","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commit/f8286a8597015e4cfd6695c29728c99a3ac01182","node_id":"C_kwDOSaL8MtoAKGY4Mjg2YTg1OTcwMTVlNGNmZDY2OTVjMjk3MjhjOTlhM2FjMDExODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commit/77af1d34bd8d05dc21daf86680b541a196fee775","sha":"77af1d34bd8d05dc21daf86680b541a196fee775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/77af1d34bd8d05dc21daf86680b541a196fee775"}],"sha":"f8286a8597015e4cfd6695c29728c99a3ac01182","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/f8286a8597015e4cfd6695c29728c99a3ac01182"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/77af1d34bd8d05dc21daf86680b541a196fee775/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:51:17Z","email":"mathewharvey@gmai.com","name":"Mathew Harvey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:51:17Z","email":"mathewharvey@gmai.com","name":"Mathew Harvey"},"message":"Add tier-specific dance videos for level avatars.\n\nEach of the six tiers × two genders has a 6-second dance clip that\nplays in two places:\n\n  * On the member dashboard hero portrait, the figure starts dancing\n    on hover (desktop) or tap (mobile), then returns to the still\n    portrait when the pointer leaves or the clip ends.\n  * On the level-up celebration overlay the dance loops for the full\n    9-second takeover, giving the tier-up moment real weight.\n\nThe raw mp4 sources have a near-white background and a generator\nwatermark in the bottom-right corner. scripts/process-dance-videos.ps1\nruns them through ffmpeg: drawbox nukes the watermark, colorkey lifts\nthe white to alpha, and libvpx-vp9 + yuva420p emits a WebM with a real\nalpha plane so the figure sits cleanly over the tier pedestal. Output\nsize lands at ~300-650 KB per clip (~5.2 MB total).\n\nTierDancer.tsx wraps the still <img> with a <video> overlay that:\n\n  * Uses preload=\"none\" until the user signals interest, so videos are\n    not fetched on page load.\n  * Pauses when scrolled off-screen via IntersectionObserver.\n  * Respects prefers-reduced-motion (degrades to the static portrait).\n  * Falls back permanently to the still on a video error, so older\n    browsers without VP9-alpha support degrade gracefully.\n  * Sets muted + playsInline + autoPlay (celebration mode) so iOS\n    WKWebView starts the clip without a user gesture.\n\nRaw mp4 sources live at src/assets/avatars/video/raw/ and are\ngit-ignored — only the cleaned-up WebMs ship.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"12c7c022b14bd7703ab25569865f125eb8ccc007","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/git/trees/12c7c022b14bd7703ab25569865f125eb8ccc007"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/git/commits/77af1d34bd8d05dc21daf86680b541a196fee775","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commit/77af1d34bd8d05dc21daf86680b541a196fee775","node_id":"C_kwDOSaL8MtoAKDc3YWYxZDM0YmQ4ZDA1ZGMyMWRhZjg2NjgwYjU0MWExOTZmZWU3NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commit/891c9dd49706bc9d02120be90f487ac34e821fa0","sha":"891c9dd49706bc9d02120be90f487ac34e821fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/891c9dd49706bc9d02120be90f487ac34e821fa0"}],"sha":"77af1d34bd8d05dc21daf86680b541a196fee775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/77af1d34bd8d05dc21daf86680b541a196fee775"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/891c9dd49706bc9d02120be90f487ac34e821fa0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:50:45Z","email":"mathewharvey@gmai.com","name":"Mathew Harvey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:50:45Z","email":"mathewharvey@gmai.com","name":"Mathew Harvey"},"message":"Keep Kanban touch scroll free on phones and polish lane chrome.\n\nThe lane and tray internal vertical scrollers were swallowing horizontal\nswipes between member lanes on touch devices because most columns had\nnothing to scroll. Scope the nested overflow to sm+ only and let the\npage handle vertical scroll on phones. Also adds a 4px accent ribbon\nalong each member lane and softens the dashed drop hint.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b4b0dd5e91877e710c8831008693a635c72d4ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/git/trees/8b4b0dd5e91877e710c8831008693a635c72d4ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/git/commits/891c9dd49706bc9d02120be90f487ac34e821fa0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commit/891c9dd49706bc9d02120be90f487ac34e821fa0","node_id":"C_kwDOSaL8MtoAKDg5MWM5ZGQ0OTcwNmJjOWQwMjEyMGJlOTBmNDg3YWMzNGU4MjFmYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commit/c23796b8d634f8c4ccf2195ccb4969b55d00e624","sha":"c23796b8d634f8c4ccf2195ccb4969b55d00e624","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/c23796b8d634f8c4ccf2195ccb4969b55d00e624"}],"sha":"891c9dd49706bc9d02120be90f487ac34e821fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/891c9dd49706bc9d02120be90f487ac34e821fa0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mathew-Harvey/ChoreBoard-Web/commits/c23796b8d634f8c4ccf2195ccb4969b55d00e624/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T13:29:47Z","email":"mathewharvey@gmai.com","name":"Mathew Harvey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T13:29:47Z","email":"mathewharvey@gmai.com","name":"Mathew Harvey"},"message":"Let TV mode avatar and chore taps reach their buttons.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cd09318e0374cd5e3cdfc79c7029ebcbbe2ae39","url":"https://api.