,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/commits/46718d4a0c0fd696402877d4882c66e2dd84d120/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T13:45:08Z","email":"nick@shpil.io","name":"Nikita Shpilevoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T13:45:08Z","email":"nick@shpil.io","name":"Nikita Shpilevoy"},"message":"refactor(healthex): tighten ingest handler + tests\n\nSelf-review cleanups after the /ingest + tests landed:\n\napp/healthex_routers.py:\n- Extract _dag_conf + _dag_run_prefix helpers, mirroring the Epic\n  pattern at app/routers.py:39,43. Was inline; inconsistent with the\n  sibling module I explicitly said I was mirroring.\n- Narrow ''except Exception'' to ''except AirflowError''. Programming\n  errors (typo in create_dag_run kwargs, etc.) now crash to 500 for\n  observability instead of being disguised as an upstream 502.\n- Generic 502 detail (''Airflow trigger failed'') instead of interpolating\n  the exception message — which included the internal Airflow URL and\n  method. Full context still goes to logs/Sentry via logger.exception.\n\ntests/test_healthex_routes.py:\n- Convert test classes to free functions to match the repo style\n  (test_routes.py, test_service.py: zero classes).\n- Delete the ''autospec rejects bogus kwargs'' meta-test — it was\n  effectively testing stdlib behavior with slippery-slope value.\n- Trim the module docstring; move fixture-specific notes back to their\n  fixtures where readers actually find them.\n- Correct the misleading /refresh block header — the client-level tests\n  it referenced don''t exist. Acknowledged as a follow-up.\n- Add explicit assertion that the internal Airflow URL does NOT appear\n  in the 502 response body (regression guard for the leak fix above).","tree":{"sha":"6de4b039a3e91ae9100af791cdb8115bea8514e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/git/trees/6de4b039a3e91ae9100af791cdb8115bea8514e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/git/commits/46718d4a0c0fd696402877d4882c66e2dd84d120","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6631578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shpilevoy","id":6631578,"login":"shpilevoy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzE1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/commit/46718d4a0c0fd696402877d4882c66e2dd84d120","node_id":"C_kwDOSaMNktoAKDQ2NzE4ZDRhMGMwZmQ2OTY0MDI4NzdkNDg4MmM2NmUyZGQ4NGQxMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/commit/61eb7c23307c23bec841c4044fdad0242c8a4da3","sha":"61eb7c23307c23bec841c4044fdad0242c8a4da3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/commits/61eb7c23307c23bec841c4044fdad0242c8a4da3"}],"sha":"46718d4a0c0fd696402877d4882c66e2dd84d120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/commits/46718d4a0c0fd696402877d4882c66e2dd84d120"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6631578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shpilevoy","id":6631578,"login":"shpilevoy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzE1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/commits/61eb7c23307c23bec841c4044fdad0242c8a4da3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T13:40:57Z","email":"nick@shpil.io","name":"Nikita Shpilevoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T13:40:57Z","email":"nick@shpil.io","name":"Nikita Shpilevoy"},"message":"test(healthex): route-level tests for /ingest + /refresh gates\n\nUses DI-via-abstract-base for the repository (InMemoryHealthExLinksRepository\nsubclasses BaseHealthExLinksRepository — signature drift on the base\nbecomes a TypeError at instantiation, not silent divergence) and\ncreate_autospec(BaseAirflowClient, instance=True, spec_set=True) for the\nAirflow client (so a bogus kwarg to create_dag_run raises TypeError in\ntests instead of quietly succeeding).\n\nCoverage:\n- /ingest happy path (initial): 202 + dag_run_id, correct conf shape.\n- /ingest happy path (incremental): sync_mode=''incremental'' + since=ISO\n  when link.last_synced_at is set.\n- /ingest 404 when no link; DAG must NOT be triggered.\n- /ingest 409 when patient_id not yet resolved; DAG must NOT be triggered.\n- /ingest 502 when Airflow trigger raises.\n- /ingest 401 when no bearer token.\n- Explicit regression guard that autospec rejects bogus kwargs — forces\n  the base-contract discussion to happen before drift lands.\n- /refresh 404 + 409 gates (thin — the pull path itself is tested at\n  the client layer; these guard against drift between /ingest and\n  /refresh preconditions).\n\nUses a scoped app fixture rather than extending conftest''s Epic app so\nsignature/dep changes to one router can''t silently break the other''s\ntests. HealthExClient is autospec''d because FastAPI eagerly resolves\nall endpoint deps before dispatch — even 404/409 paths need it in\napp.state.","tree":{"sha":"d923bd900a39a232ed2d13e551326a9690ccd3ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/git/trees/d923bd900a39a232ed2d13e551326a9690ccd3ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/fhir_importers/git/commits/61eb7c23307c23bec841c4044fdad0242c8a4da3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6631578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shpilevoy","id":6631578,"login":"shpilevoy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzE1Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shpilevoy/received_events","repos