-08-30T16:40:56Z","email":"hvhai22@gmail.com","name":"pikann22"},"message":"fix: give locally-scoped JSONBody[T] body types unique names\n\nTinyGo''s generic-function monomorphization keys plugin.JSONBody[T]\ninstantiations by T''s bare type name rather than its full declaration\nsite. createScenario and updateScenario each declared their own\n`type body struct{...}` with the same name but different fields\n(string vs *string) -- TinyGo collapsed them into one shared field\nlayout, so json.Unmarshal could decode against the wrong struct\n(differing field sizes here, not just differing field counts).\n\nRenamed both to createScenarioBody / updateScenarioBody.\n\nPart of a coordinated fix across all first-party plugins; see\nPaca-AI/paca#445 and Paca-AI/paca-plugin-github#24 for the full\nroot-cause writeup and verification.","tree":{"sha":"486d0e04f8559c56c6f6be4cb1592ecd090c71f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-bdd/git/trees/486d0e04f8559c56c6f6be4cb1592ecd090c71f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-bdd/git/commits/a270a610ad17c22c77ee69f72284e7ef9ad3991d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41873019?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pikann","id":41873019,"login":"pikann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODczMDE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pikann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip