il.com","name":"Nilesh Shinde"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:59:16.942Z","repositoryId":1235730735,"sha":"7cd49e6cc98712fe558f04399d82d6b0a970f8d4"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:59:16.942Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesh0604/f500/commits/c5c8e7712197dabcab476b13db74a53c35e2e8bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:20:05Z","email":"nilesh0604@gmail.com","name":"Nilesh Shinde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:20:05Z","email":"nilesh0604@gmail.com","name":"Nilesh Shinde"},"message":"fix(security): remove secrets, employer-confidential info, and personal data from repo\n\n- Replace real Langfuse API keys in .env.local.example with placeholders\n- Remove EPAM CodeMie metadata headers and footers from 7 SCRUM-21 docs\n- Externalize vyasaDomainName to VYASA_DOMAIN_NAME env var in infra config\n- Remove hardcoded Jira URL fallback in ai-dev CLI; require JIRA_BASE_URL\n- Redact AWS Account ID in all doc files with <AWS_ACCOUNT_ID> placeholder\n- Untrack infra/cdk.context.json (auto-generated) and add to .gitignore\n- Add docs/F500_ENTERPRISE_ACTION_ITEMS.md to track enterprise-grade gaps\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac0e93adf8ae8d9ae78f6c4da7fcfa6e28b6c0ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesh0604/f500/git/trees/ac0e93adf8ae8d9ae78f6c4da7fcfa6e28b6c0ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesh0604/f500/git/commits/c5c8e7712197dabcab476b13db74a53c35e2e8bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nilesh0604/f500/commit/c5c8e7712197dabcab476b13db74a53c35e2e8bf","node_id":"C_kwDOSafBL9oAKGM1YzhlNzcxMjE5N2RhYmNhYjQ3NmIxM2RiNzRhNTNjMzVlMmU4YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nilesh0604/f500/commit/1a34f3f8446142189410081e00b043707b21f05b","sha":"1a34f3f84