\n- Add firebase.json as full PaaS agent: Firestore, Security Rules\n  (deny-first, Custom Claims RBAC, App Check), Auth, Cloud Functions\n  (TypeScript, 2nd Gen, idempotency), Cloud Storage, Hosting, FCM push\n  notifications, pricing optimization\n- Add supabase.json as full PaaS agent: PostgreSQL + extensions (pgvector,\n  pg_cron), RLS (subselect pattern), Auth/GoTrue, Edge Functions\n  (TypeScript/Deno), Realtime (Broadcast/Presence/Postgres Changes),\n  Storage, CLI migrations, Vault secrets\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Update _meta.json: add visibility + commonInfo (connection pooling,\n  migrations, data validation, backup, multi-tenancy, secrets management)\n- Add Firebase to Flutter and React Native presets\n- Add Supabase to React SPA, React+Next.js, and Telegram Mini App presets\n- Regenerate GENERATED_PAGES_CONFIG","tree":{"sha":"81d92b6ea80a32144ae9c4aeb105de2ae330e208","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MCP-COOP-ORG/ai-plugin-constructor/git/trees/81d92b6ea80a32144ae9c4aeb105de2ae330e208"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MCP-COOP-ORG/ai-plugin-constructor/git/commits/fd9db66133c37b313a5f2a859a076147016d55f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3286958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shpakowski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shpakowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shpakowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shpakowski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shpakowski","id":3286958,"login":"Shpakowski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODY5NTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shpakowski/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shpakowski/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shpakowski/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.gith