,"html_url":"https://github.com/romer8","id":43544549,"login":"romer8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQ0NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commits/852cf8f09ddd90984ad36c64d349829c3d139678/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T18:28:17Z","email":"gio.rombus@gmail.com","name":"romer8"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T18:28:17Z","email":"gio.rombus@gmail.com","name":"romer8"},"message":"fix(cors): expose Mcp-Session-Id to browser JS\n\nWithout expose_headers, the @modelcontextprotocol/sdk Streamable HTTP\nclient cannot read the session ID from the initialize response on\ncross-origin requests. The SDK falls back to no session header on the\nfollow-up POST and the server returns 400 Bad Request: Missing session ID.\n\nSymptom reproduced on workshop VM in fresh Edge + private Brave; masked\nin normal Brave by a stale preflight cache from an earlier server config.","tree":{"sha":"2859cfd8cbcf9dac2253dd5ff0b2e76109479be0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/git/trees/2859cfd8cbcf9dac2253dd5ff0b2e76109479be0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/git/commits/852cf8f09ddd90984ad36c64d349829c3d139678","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43544549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/romer8","id":43544549,"login":"romer8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQ0NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commit/852cf8f09ddd90984ad36c64d349829c3d139678","node_id":"C_kwDOSajnbNoAKDg1MmNmOGYwOWRkZDkwOTg0YWQzNmM2NGQzNDk4MjljM2QxMzk2Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commit/49c73af50e24986c0ae2ade1581087d94860234f","sha":"49c73af50e24986c0ae2ade1581087d94860234f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commits/49c73af50e24986c0ae2ade1581087d94860234f"}],"sha":"852cf8f09ddd90984ad36c64d349829c3d139678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commits/852cf8f09ddd90984ad36c64d349829c3d139678"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43544549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/romer8","id":43544549,"login":"romer8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQ0NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commits/49c73af50e24986c0ae2ade1581087d94860234f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T03:45:59Z","email":"gio.rombus@gmail.com","name":"romer8"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T03:45:59Z","email":"gio.rombus@gmail.com","name":"romer8"},"message":"fix: ESRI layer-name resolution falls back to layer 0 for single-layer services + reads layer_id arg\n\nThe LLM often omits layer_id when the prompt says only ''add the X ESRI layer\nfrom <url>'' — most NOAA MapServer URLs publish a single layer at index 0, so\nthis is the dominant case. Previously the resolver gave up on\nlayer_id=None and the attributeVariables ended up keyed by the display name,\ncausing silent click-time lookup failure (popup attributes never routed to\nvariable inputs).\n\nTwo changes:\n- _resolve_esri_layer_name now fetches service metadata even when layer_id\n  is None. If the service publishes exactly one layer, return its name.\n- add_esri_image_layer wires the layer_id arg into effective_layer_id (was\n  only reading from params.LAYERS / params.LAYERDEFS).","tree":{"sha":"eb937be59b1f7adeb9ff71a076809681e2d19bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/git/trees/eb937be59b1f7adeb9ff71a076809681e2d19bd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/git/commits/49c73af50e24986c0ae2ade1581087d94860234f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43544549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/romer8","id":43544549,"login":"romer8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQ0NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commit/49c73af50e24986c0ae2ade1581087d94860234f","node_id":"C_kwDOSajnbNoAKDQ5YzczYWY1MGUyNDk4NmMwYWUyYWRlMTU4MTA4N2Q5NDg2MDIzNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commit/8f72d643987be0a08cf972405cff309784988a17","sha":"8f72d643987be0a08cf972405cff309784988a17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commits/8f72d643987be0a08cf972405cff309784988a17"}],"sha":"49c73af50e24986c0ae2ade1581087d94860234f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commits/49c73af50e24986c0ae2ade1581087d94860234f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43544549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/romer8","id":43544549,"login":"romer8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQ0NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/commits/8f72d643987be0a08cf972405cff309784988a17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T22:17:47Z","email":"gio.rombus@gmail.com","name":"romer8"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T22:17:47Z","email":"gio.rombus@gmail.com","name":"romer8"},"message":"fix(tools): default records-mode scatter traces to lines-only\n\n_records_to_traces was emitting mode: \"lines+markers\" on auto-pivoted\nscatter traces. For time series with hundreds of points the markers\nclutter the plot. Switch to mode: \"lines\" — callers can still pass\nexplicit mode in pre-built trace objects.","tree":{"sha":"7d775ff7bf5a914913f9cd4a9c20dc271eb55755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/git/trees/7d775ff7bf5a914913f9cd4a9c20dc271eb55755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Aquaveo/tethysdash_mcps/git/commits/8f72d643987be0a08cf972405cff309784988a17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43544549?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/romer8","id":43544549,"login":"romer8","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQ0NTQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romer8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/