when a specific category is selected (filtered mode)\n- Hub-and-spoke layout: primary nodes in inner ring, related nodes outer ring\n- Dynamic radius calculation guarantees ≥ 240px arc-per-node — no overlapping\n- Related nodes capped at 14 (sorted by certification priority)\n- Only edges between visible nodes are drawn\n- Node click: dims unrelated nodes to 8% opacity, animates active edges\n- Click pane to reset dimming\n- AnimatePresence crossfade between overview ↔ graph modes\n- Breadcrumb status bar shows current focus context\n- Focused-mode badge with category color and glow\n- GraphCanvas child component owns ReactFlow state (clean separation)\n- Right detail panel: concept info, connected concept chips, full-view CTA\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4acf72af8cfd80cd5963e069358ca979e9583755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajeshuriti/claude-terminology/git/trees/4acf72af8cfd80cd5963e069358ca979e9583755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajeshuriti/claude-terminology/git/commits/35709e28907f13c02d03322d93528efb03721dc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11350143?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajeshuriti/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajeshuriti/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajeshuriti/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajeshuriti/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rajeshuriti","id":11350143,"login":"rajeshuriti","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzUwMTQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajeshuriti/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajeshuriti/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajeshuriti/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajeshuriti/starre