ate":"2026-06-04T14:04:01Z","email":"rianbl@hotmail.com","name":"Rian Lopes"},"message":"refactor(rag): restructure ingestion and retrieval pipeline for multi-format document chunking\n\nreplace CSV-only schema flow with document-centric storage model\nintroduce PostgreSQL tables for documents and chunks with metadata\nadd unified ingestion pipeline for CSV, TXT, and PDF inputs\nimplement normalization and simple chunking with overlap\npersist chunked content and source metadata for retrieval\nmigrate search service to build FAISS index from chunk corpus\nswitch retrieval from row-based records to top-k chunk retrieval\nkeep FAISS as isolated in-memory RAG service (no index persistence)\nupdate upload API to validate supported file types and trigger index refresh\nupdate UI/README to reflect multi-format upload and chunk-based RAG architecture","tree":{"sha":"1ae43d9a912a1555ba91f236a93dcf9a9ee4ea55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rianbl/knowledge-studio/git/trees/1ae43d9a912a1555ba91f236a93dcf9a9ee4ea55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rianbl/knowledge-studio/git/commits/a13cfd5f624d43af2f549044d3e17b1a6f3148d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77791275?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rianbl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rianbl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rianbl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rianbl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rianbl","id":77791275,"login":"rianbl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NzkxMjc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rianbl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rianbl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rianbl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rianbl/starred{/own