te_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/a68407c800026bf81d6ca946e32b1cd96fcbb14f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:06:53Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:06:53Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"feat: Combined documents get the real POL-PRO compound code\n\nA document drafted as \"Combined\" (policy + procedure in one) previously\ngot a plain POL code — indistinguishable from an ordinary Policy, and\nmissing the compound-type recognition that agents/cdi_checker/service.py''s\nis_valid_doc_code()/is_combined_document() and the extractor''s\nCODE_PREFIX_MAP already have logic for (built for the real legacy\nconvention, e.g. DRG-QI-POL-PRO-NCA). Now TYPE_CODES[\"Combined\"] =\n\"POL-PRO\", so a new Combined document''s code actually carries that\nmeaning, and is correctly recognised end-to-end: code validation, the CDI\nchecker''s \"combined document\" note, and extraction classification\n(already mapped \"-POL-PRO-\" -> Policy-type extraction).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"313160cd7bb170c6ff7a9d19df102659bf752b8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/313160cd7bb170c6ff7a9d19df102659bf752b8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/a68407c800026bf81d6ca946e32b1cd96fcbb14f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/a68407c800026bf81d6ca946e32b1cd96fcbb14f","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGE2ODQwN2M4MDAwMjZiZjgxZDZjYTk0NmUzMmIxY2Q5NmZjYmIxNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/d40071da33bae21f53412074eeb69e4e25074cef","sha":"d40071da33bae21f53412074eeb69e4e25074cef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/d40071da33bae21f53412074eeb69e4e25074cef"}],"sha":"a68407c800026bf81d6ca946e32b1cd96fcbb14f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/a68407c800026bf81d6ca946e32b1cd96fcbb14f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/d40071da33bae21f53412074eeb69e4e25074cef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:51:28Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:51:28Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: Document Register DocumentType enum missing 5 CDT document types\n\ngrc.schemas.DocumentType only accepted Policy/Procedure/SOP/Form/Guidelines\n— but the CDT master templates and the AI Drafter''s own dropdown offer\nPolicy/Procedure/Combined/Manual/Guideline/Standard/SLA. Approving a\nCombined/Manual/Standard/SLA/Guideline document wrote to the Register fine,\nbut every subsequent read crashed with a Pydantic validation error (or, on\nthe list endpoint, was silently skipped rather than erroring).\n\nAdded the 5 missing values. Kept the legacy GUIDELINES (plural) distinct\nfrom the new GUIDELINE (singular, what the CDT template file and dropdown\nactually use) rather than merging them, so no existing Register row is\nreinterpreted. Also updated the Document Register''s own manual \"+Register\ndocument\" form dropdown to offer all 7 types, not just the original 5.\n\nAdded a parametrized regression test asserting every CDT document type is\na valid Register DocumentType, so this can''t silently regress.\n\nVerified against live data this doesn''t explain an earlier document-count\ndiscrepancy the user noticed (none of the 4 current Register documents\nhit this), but it was a live landmine for the next Combined/Manual/\nStandard/SLA document anyone approves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87146dbe0d4ca687c31a35f2f24f8f08105d604e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/87146dbe0d4ca687c31a35f2f24f8f08105d604e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/d40071da33bae21f53412074eeb69e4e25074cef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/d40071da33bae21f53412074eeb69e4e25074cef","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGQ0MDA3MWRhMzNiYWUyMWY1MzQxMjA3NGVlYjY5ZTRlMjUwNzRjZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/c4ad17c1be41f2155104fc4f8c76482615736a80","sha":"c4ad17c1be41f2155104fc4f8c76482615736a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/c4ad17c1be41f2155104fc4f8c76482615736a80"}],"sha":"d40071da33bae21f53412074eeb69e4e25074cef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/d40071da33bae21f53412074eeb69e4e25074cef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/c4ad17c1be41f2155104fc4f8c76482615736a80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:39:51Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:39:51Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"feat: CDT cover facts + PDF preview now work on the Document Register too\n\nPreviously only Document Lifecycle items had a \"Cover & preview\" action —\nonce a document was approved and moved to the Register, there was no way\nto edit its cover facts or preview it as a PDF, even though the data\n(CDTCoverFacts/RevisionHistory) and the merge context builder\n(MergeContext.from_document_read) already existed for exactly this case.\n\n- grc/router.py: GET/PATCH .../documents/{id}/cover and\n  GET .../documents/{id}/preview.pdf, mirroring the Lifecycle equivalents\n  and reusing the same merge engine — same request/response shape, so the\n  existing CdtCoverPanel component works unchanged against either.\n- frontend: \"Cover & preview\" button + panel wired into the Document\n  Register detail view.\n\nAlso: a friendlier error message when someone tries to preview/merge a\ndocument that isn''t actually a .docx file (a PDF or old .doc upload) —\npreviously surfaced a raw BadZipFile traceback-style message.\n\n7 new tests (grc cover/preview endpoints). 183 passing total, same 3\npre-existing unrelated respx/token-mock failures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66459fb664ab9fcfac3d3bde95dde9aa42cc98ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/66459fb664ab9fcfac3d3bde95dde9aa42cc98ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/c4ad17c1be41f2155104fc4f8c76482615736a80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/c4ad17c1be41f2155104fc4f8c76482615736a80","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGM0YWQxN2MxYmU0MWYyMTU1MTA0ZmM0ZjhjNzY0ODI2MTU3MzZhODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/28a0b67dbb7c9edeb4dcde538fa47efd2f5108f3","sha":"28a0b67dbb7c9edeb4dcde538fa47efd2f5108f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/28a0b67dbb7c9edeb4dcde538fa47efd2f5108f3"}],"sha":"c4ad17c1be41f2155104fc4f8c76482615736a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/c4ad17c1be41f2155104fc4f8c76482615736a80"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/28a0b67dbb7c9edeb4dcde538fa47efd2f5108f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:00:55Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T15:00:55Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: reextract_by_code.py checks the lifecycle item''s file link first\n\nThe Document Register''s SharePointUrl isn''t always populated (or points at\na stale copy) — SharePointFileUrl on the Document Lifecycle item is the\nmore reliable source. Falls back to the register if no lifecycle match.\nRestores an improvement made directly on the production server that a\nplain repo pull would otherwise have silently overwritten.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"653048363b7e8cdf96431299d6a5b961651eb187","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/653048363b7e8cdf96431299d6a5b961651eb187"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/28a0b67dbb7c9edeb4dcde538fa47efd2f5108f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/28a0b67dbb7c9edeb4dcde538fa47efd2f5108f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDI4YTBiNjdkYmI3YzllZGViNGRjZGU1MzhmYTQ3ZWZkMmY1MTA4ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/d469505298dce59604138fc79bab1976cd86a316","sha":"d469505298dce59604138fc79bab1976cd86a316","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/d469505298dce59604138fc79bab1976cd86a316"}],"sha":"28a0b67dbb7c9edeb4dcde538fa47efd2f5108f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/28a0b67dbb7c9edeb4dcde538fa47efd2f5108f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/d469505298dce59604138fc79bab1976cd86a316/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:31:35Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:31:35Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"feat: Controlled Document Templating (CDT) v06 — full backend + frontend rebuild\n\nRebuilds the document register/lifecycle around a real, marker-based master\ntemplate per document type (Policy, Procedure, Combined, Manual, Guideline,\nStandard, SLA), styled to exactly match Dragnet''s real, already-issued\ndocuments (logo, fonts, colours, table shading — reverse-engineered from\ndocs/Acceptable Use Standard- V2.docx).\n\n- lifecycle/{schemas,templates,merge}.py: the CDT data model, master\n  template fetch/validation, and the deterministic docxtpl merge engine\n  (AI never touches the file; only this merges cover facts in).\n- lifecycle/graft.py: attaches a CDT cover onto a document that has none —\n  either written by hand outside the template, or an existing document\n  being brought onto CDT for the first time. Never destructive (backs up\n  the original upload first).\n- lifecycle/router.py: cover facts CRUD + live PDF preview, the new\n  POST .../attach-cover endpoint, version-bump + re-merge at approval, and\n  download/CDI-check now always operate on the merged, symbol-free content\n  once a document is templated.\n- agents/policy_drafter/: AI drafts now build on the real master template\n  instead of a hand-rolled cover.\n- scripts/build_cdt_master_templates.py: generates and uploads the 7 master\n  templates to the ORGOS LIBRARY.\n- frontend: CdtCoverPanel (cover facts + PDF preview) and the new \"Attach\n  CDT cover\" action in Document Lifecycle.\n- observability.py + OpenTelemetry wiring in main.py/config.py/requirements.txt\n  for Grafana export.\n\nAlso includes production-hardening fixes (document code validator accepts\nv06 no-suffix and legacy shapes, combined policy+procedure control-number\ndetection).\n\n175+ tests passing (graft engine, attach-cover endpoint, approval-time\nmerge, template validation, register bridge) — only the 3 pre-existing,\nunrelated respx/token-mock failures remain, present before this work.\n\nRequires two manual SharePoint columns already added by an admin:\nCDTCoverFacts and RevisionHistory (Multiple lines of text) on both the\nDocument Lifecycle and Document Register lists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5732e84c2e6631db72750cdfeeea349f7f18d65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/d5732e84c2e6631db72750cdfeeea349f7f18d65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/d469505298dce59604138fc79bab1976cd86a316","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/d469505298dce59604138fc79bab1976cd86a316","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGQ0Njk1MDUyOThkY2U1OTYwNDEzOGZjNzliYWIxOTc2Y2Q4NmEzMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/630f9a520d1939ff17b14754cdd4f0526b6fb995","sha":"630f9a520d1939ff17b14754cdd4f0526b6fb995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/630f9a520d1939ff17b14754cdd4f0526b6fb995"}],"sha":"d469505298dce59604138fc79bab1976cd86a316","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/d469505298dce59604138fc79bab1976cd86a316"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/630f9a520d1939ff17b14754cdd4f0526b6fb995/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:52:58Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:52:58Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: document code validator accepts v06 no-suffix and all real legacy shapes\n\nCDI v06 (§4.0 Coding) retired the trailing -SERIAL-YEAR suffix — a code\nnow stops at the document ID (DRG-QI-PRO-CDI, not DRG-QI-PRO-CDI-01-26).\nConfirmed by the compliance officer: the new-format cover template is\nfinal, and Wani (Victoria Shobayo) is converting the ~112 legacy-format\ndocuments herself with no fixed cutover date, so both new and legacy\ncode shapes must validate indefinitely, side by side.\n\nis_valid_doc_code() previously matched two fixed regexes (both requiring\na -SERIAL-YEAR suffix), so it rejected every new-format document and\nevery combined policy-and-procedure document with a single trailing\nserial and no year — including DRG-QI-POL-PRO-NCA-01, the exact\nNonconformity & Corrective Action document originally reported as\nwrongly flagged ''no control number''. The earlier combined-document fix\nhad assumed the wrong shape (DRG-QI-POL-PRO-NCA-01-26, with a year) and\nso did not actually fix that document.\n\nReplaced the fixed regexes with a structural check that accepts every\nreal shape found in a live scan of the ORGOS LIBRARY (121 documents):\nnew canonical, new combined, legacy standard, legacy combined (with or\nwithout a year), and legacy with no distinct mnemonic before the\nserial. Verified against the full library: 23 codes that failed the old\nvalidator now all pass; 0 failures remain. find_doc_code_in_text()\n(recovers a code from the document body when the register field is\nblank) updated the same way — it now finds candidates of any shape and\nvalidates each, rather than only matching the old suffixed forms.\n\nRewrote tests/agents/test_cdi_doc_code.py against the real shapes (the\nprior version tested the wrong assumed shape for the combined case).\n21/21 pass. Full suite: 144 passed, only the pre-existing unrelated\nrespx token-mock failures remain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7bcdffc233e28855930ab483c23b27b5dde00c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/d7bcdffc233e28855930ab483c23b27b5dde00c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/630f9a520d1939ff17b14754cdd4f0526b6fb995","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/630f9a520d1939ff17b14754cdd4f0526b6fb995","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDYzMGY5YTUyMGQxOTM5ZmYxN2IxNDc1NGNkZDRmMDUyNmI2ZmI5OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/f0d69999c0333572f4de9702c14a8068d980f625","sha":"f0d69999c0333572f4de9702c14a8068d980f625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/f0d69999c0333572f4de9702c14a8068d980f625"}],"sha":"630f9a520d1939ff17b14754cdd4f0526b6fb995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/630f9a520d1939ff17b14754cdd4f0526b6fb995"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/f0d69999c0333572f4de9702c14a8068d980f625/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:00:07Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:00:07Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: combined policy+procedure documents no longer flagged \"no control number\"\n\nThe earlier combined-document change only helped once a compound code had\nalready reached CDI-01 — but the code never got that far, so documents like\n\"Nonconformity and Corrective Action Policy and Procedure\" were still\nreported as having no control number.\n\nRoot cause: the code-search pattern could not match a compound POL-PRO code\n(DRG-QI-POL-PRO-NCA-01-26), so intake stored DocumentCode = \"\" and CDI-01\nthen reported \"No document code provided\". Several other places validated\nwith the narrow pattern too, so even a stored compound code was rejected at\napproval and on publish to the Document Register.\n\n- cdi_checker: DOC_CODE_SEARCH_PATTERN now matches standard AND compound\n  codes; new is_valid_doc_code() and find_doc_code_in_text() helpers.\n- CDI-01: when no code is recorded on the item, recover it from the document\n  body before declaring one missing (passes with a note saying where it came\n  from). Genuinely missing and genuinely malformed codes still fail.\n- Everything that validated a code now uses is_valid_doc_code(): intake,\n  patch_bare_lifecycle_items, publish_approved_lifecycle,\n  audit_document_register_codes, the two lifecycle approval gates, and the\n  Document Register create path.\n- 11 regression tests covering find/validate/CDI-01 for both code forms.","tree":{"sha":"dcf80b226a8037f70104ed92e362e92bafd9ca1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/dcf80b226a8037f70104ed92e362e92bafd9ca1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/f0d69999c0333572f4de9702c14a8068d980f625","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id"