pproving authority (while awaiting approval) and reversing a wrong\napproval (with a mandatory reason). Marks the approver commitment and the\nownership-visibility UI follow-ups as done in the completion plan.","tree":{"sha":"c7517800a051f13f7b410cdb149a92494a32f936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/c7517800a051f13f7b410cdb149a92494a32f936"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/a51fa969fd13e20e9cdfdd4362394fbe6f862cdc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/a51fa969fd13e20e9cdfdd4362394fbe6f862cdc","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGE1MWZhOTY5ZmQxM2UyMGU5Y2RmZGQ0MzYyMzk0ZmJlNmY4NjJjZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/49816d4295a91dbb0ba62a8c2a3c887271b3e101","sha":"49816d4295a91dbb0ba62a8c2a3c887271b3e101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/49816d4295a91dbb0ba62a8c2a3c887271b3e101"}],"sha":"a51fa969fd13e20e9cdfdd4362394fbe6f862cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/a51fa969fd13e20e9cdfdd4362394fbe6f862cdc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/49816d4295a91dbb0ba62a8c2a3c887271b3e101/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T07:41:46Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T07:41:46Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"feat: approver correction/reversal + ownership visibility across the UI\n\nApprover (meeting commitment: \"even after submission, Compliance and\ndocument owners must be able to reverse or edit it\"):\n- PATCH /lifecycle/documents/{id}/approver — correct the approving\n  authority on a document awaiting approval, without sending it back a\n  stage. Compliance OR the document owner.\n- POST /lifecycle/documents/{id}/reverse-approval — undo an approval\n  that shouldn''t have happened: the document returns to Approval and the\n  Document Register entry it created is WITHDRAWN (never hard-deleted).\n  Requires a reason; both actions are audit-logged.\n\nOwnership visibility (§2.7):\n- OwnerDisplay component: shows the role, a GROUP / JOB TITLE /\n  UNASSIGNED badge, the people who actually hold it (expandable), and an\n  alias note (\"matched via alias X → Y\") so resolution is trustworthy.\n  Used on controls, evidence and the standards drill-down.\n- Controls and evidence now carry resolved owner data from the API\n  (OwnerPeople / OwnerKind / OwnerResolved / OwnerCanonical /\n  OwnerViaAlias).\n- Org roles: \"Show all staff\" toggle — 38 org-role holders or all 98\n  internal staff — plus an \"Owns\" column with controls/evidence counts\n  per role, and the same counts on each group card.\n- GET /org-roles/ownership-summary backs those counts.\n- \"Blocked\" wording aligned everywhere to mean the role resolves to\n  nobody.","tree":{"sha":"1e0cddd512f1fd8b91c1c35af4ad74d0583edcde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/1e0cddd512f1fd8b91c1c35af4ad74d0583edcde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/49816d4295a91dbb0ba62a8c2a3c887271b3e101","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su