","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"docs: correct the job-title data picture and reframe §3.1\n\nThe earlier ''117 of 198 have no job title'' figure was wrong — it counted\n96 external guests and a set of shared/booking mailboxes. Verified\nagainst the live tenant: 98 Dragnet staff accounts, 77 with job titles,\n55 distinct titles; the ~21 without are almost all mailboxes/bots.\n\nThe meeting''s complaint was an outdated Entra *export* — that static\nlist was deleted in the ERP merge and OrgOS now reads Entra live, so it\ncan''t go stale the same way. §3.1 therefore drops from ''blocked: build a\nSeamless HR integration'' to a single process question for Isaac: does a\ntitle change in Seamless HR reach Entra? No OrgOS integration required\neither way.","tree":{"sha":"5def5aa00dd1a2c895dcadf9604081bdc6e55ad8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/5def5aa00dd1a2c895dcadf9604081bdc6e55ad8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/625ede36de0d3b4fbb3727603469aed4e6a9fe4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","u