,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swaveyxi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swaveyxi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/cab3163157c9c91db8a63e45c175b860e09304d3","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGNhYjMxNjMxNTdjOWM5MWRiOGE2M2U0NWMxNzViODYwZTA5MzA0ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/10968e462569e9581e3a11862782516092ed0890","sha":"10968e462569e9581e3a11862782516092ed0890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/10968e462569e9581e3a11862782516092ed0890"}],"sha":"cab3163157c9c91db8a63e45c175b860e09304d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/cab3163157c9c91db8a63e45c175b860e09304d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/10968e462569e9581e3a11862782516092ed0890/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T12:34:12Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T12:34:12Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: CDI fix plan re-runs the check on the live document\n\nThe fix plan was built from the failures stored on the document. Any\ndocument that failed CDI before the enriched-finding format shipped had\nonly {check, detail, fix} saved — no find/replace/fixable — so every\nfinding defaulted to \"manual\" and nothing was applyable.\n\nThe plan now re-runs the CDI check on the live file to get fresh,\nlocatable fix data (find/replace/anchor/fixable), self-healing those\nolder documents without a re-upload. Falls back to the stored failures\nonly if the live re-check cannot run (e.g. LLM unavailable).","tree":{"sha":"5f9c24c057e3a1005b187e4cb83e39659f2cfbe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/5f9c24c057e3a1005b187e4cb83e39659f2cfbe7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/10968e462569e9581e3a11862782516092ed0890","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/10968e462569e9581e3a11862782516092ed0890","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDEwOTY4ZTQ2MjU2OWU5NTgxZTNhMTE4NjI3ODI1MTYwOTJlZDA4OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/a188ecd79b2b6c799fb0514d4de698c7743ea9fe","sha":"a188ecd79b2b6c799fb0514d4de698c7743ea9fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/a188ecd79b2b6c799fb0514d4de698c7743ea9fe"}],"sha":"10968e462569e9581e3a11862782516092ed0890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/10968e462569e9581e3a11862782516092ed0890"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/a188ecd79b2b6c799fb0514d4de698c7743ea9fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T12:14:15Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T12:14:15Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"feat: CDI auto-fix — guided confirm-and-apply for CDI failures\n\nFix CDI failures by applying the AI''s suggested edit to the document,\nwith a human confirming every change. The AI never touches the file:\nat check time it produces an exact find/replace pair, and a\ndeterministic engine locates and applies it, verifies, and saves a new\nversion (original preserved in SharePoint history).\n\n- fixer.py: pure, run-split-aware, formatting-preserving locate+apply\n  over body/tables/headers/footers; normalises quotes/nbsp/dashes;\n  verify + per-fix rollback; fail-safe when text can''t be located\n  uniquely. Covered by tests/agents/test_cdi_fixer.py.\n- cdi_checker: findings now carry find/replace/anchor/needs_choice/\n  choices/fixable so fixes are applyable, not just describable; a\n  verbatim guard rejects any AI paraphrase not present in the sentence.\n- lifecycle: /cdi-fix/plan (locate status per finding) and\n  /cdi-fix/apply (apply confirmed fixes, re-run CDI, audit-log each);\n  full findings persisted in CDIFailures.\n- UI: CdiFixPanel — per-issue cards with highlighted text, editable\n  replacement, live before/after preview, choice dropdowns, occurrence\n  picker, batch confirm, and a re-check result screen. PDFs guidance-only.\n- fix: bulk_extract.py awaits the now-async text extractors.","tree":{"sha":"43f4042897d9b61af989dd673e050e066365f4c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/43f4042897d9b61af989dd673e050e066365f4c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/a188ecd79b2b6c799fb0514d4de698c7743ea9fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/a188ecd79b2b6c799fb0514d4de698c7743ea9fe","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGExODhlY2Q3OWIyYjZjNzk5ZmIwNTE0ZDRkZTY5OGM3NzQzZWE5ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/7ac03438a1d1424c64a56d2f72f8fa7f1afbf1dd","sha":"7ac03438a1d1424c64a56d2f72f8fa7f1afbf1dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/7ac03438a1d1424c64a56d2f72f8fa7f1afbf1dd"}],"sha":"a188ecd79b2b6c799fb0514d4de698c7743ea9fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/a188ecd79b2b6c799fb0514d4de698c7743ea9fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/7ac03438a1d1424c64a56d2f72f8fa7f1afbf1dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:59:39Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:59:39Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: also tell the CDI-16 prompt not to flag collective terms (belt-and-suspenders)\n\nAdds the collective/audience term guidance to the CDI-16 LLM prompt so the model avoids returning ''All Staff'' etc. in the first place, catching fuzzier variants the exact-match skip-list would miss.","tree":{"sha":"a0e473379f66be7c86688fd77a825dd6797c8f3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/a0e473379f66be7c86688fd77a825dd6797c8f3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/7ac03438a1d1424c64a56d2f72f8fa7f1afbf1dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/7ac03438a1d1424c64a56d2f72f8fa7f1afbf1dd","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDdhYzAzNDM4YTFkMTQyNGM2NGE1NmQyZjcyZjhmYTdmMWFmYmYxZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/5f1ab454df1446255a8e2ffd99fc66d151099674","sha":"5f1ab454df1446255a8e2ffd99fc66d151099674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/5f1ab454df1446255a8e2ffd99fc66d151099674"}],"sha":"7ac03438a1d1424c64a56d2f72f8fa7f1afbf1dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/7ac03438a1d1424c64a56d2f72f8fa7f1afbf1dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/5f1ab454df1446255a8e2ffd99fc66d151099674/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:19:34Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:19:34Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: CDI-16 no longer flags collective terms like ''All Staff'' as unregistered roles\n\nCDI-07/08 (the literal ''vague term'' checks) were already disabled, but CDI-16 (unregistered role reference) still flagged legitimate collective/audience/distribution terms — ''All Staff'', ''staff'', ''all users'', ''management'', etc. — because they are not Role Register titles. These are added to the _NON_ROLE_SUBJECTS skip-list, and the AI path now applies that skip-list too (previously only the fallback path did). CDI-16 still catches genuinely made-up specific roles.","tree":{"sha":"7a1c4b08810a66a016512f35386677bb486f50d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/7a1c4b08810a66a016512f35386677bb486f50d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/5f1ab454df1446255a8e2ffd99fc66d151099674","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/5f1ab454df1446255a8e2ffd99fc66d151099674","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDVmMWFiNDU0ZGYxNDQ2MjU1YThlMmZmZDk5ZmM2NmQxNTEwOTk2NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/8c4a1b770dd5963d2310a27163ed75cc8c0c429f","sha":"8c4a1b770dd5963d2310a27163ed75cc8c0c429f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/8c4a1b770dd5963d2310a27163ed75cc8c0c429f"}],"sha":"5f1ab454df1446255a8e2ffd99fc66d151099674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/5f1ab454df1446255a8e2ffd99fc66d151099674"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/8c4a1b770dd5963d2310a27163ed75cc8c0c429f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:04:19Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T10:04:19Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"perf: move blocking work off the event loop + cache standards map (durability Phase 3)\n\nA5 (agents/extractor/service.py): pypdf and mammoth text extraction now run via asyncio.to_thread — a large/scanned document no longer blocks the event loop for every other request.\n\nA2 (agents/classifier/service.py): the O(n²) near-duplicate and conflict SequenceMatcher scans (which ran after every extraction) are extracted into pure functions run via asyncio.to_thread, with a statement-length pre-filter and norms computed once — so classification no longer freezes the event loop as the registers grow.\n\nA4 (standards_map/router.py): the map endpoint indexes evidence by control id once (O(E)) instead of scanning all evidence per clause (O(clauses × controls × evidence)), and caches the computed map for 15s to spare the two full-register reads on rapid dashboard refreshes.\n\nAdds 10 tests. Deferred (documented in the hardening audit): A1 background-job the direct extract endpoints, A3 cap/bound the classifier LLM fan-out, A6 read-side write removal, A8 RunPod poll bound.","tree":{"sha":"768e21c53e3fdbf2cea0a063b54ef63683511137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/768e21c53e3fdbf2cea0a063b54ef63683511137"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/8c4a1b770dd5963d2310a27163ed75cc8c0c429f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/8c4a1b770dd5963d2310a27163ed75cc8c0c429f","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDhjNGExYjc3MGRkNTk2M2QyMzEwYTI3MTYzZWQ3NWNjOGMwYzQyOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/62a62ee0b17cd774786bc42428dc2a553a74a156","sha":"62a62ee0b17cd774786bc42428dc2a553a74a156","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/62a62ee0b17cd774786bc42428dc2a553a74a156"}],"sha":"8c4a1b770dd5963d2310a27163ed75cc8c0c429f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/8c4a1b770dd5963d2310a27163ed75cc8c0c429f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/62a62ee0b17cd774786bc42428dc2a553a74a156/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:52:21Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:52:21Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"harden: idempotency + state guards on decision cascades (durability Phase 2)\n\nI1/I1b (review_queue): zone1_decide now refuses to act on an already-decided item (409) and no longer leaves an orphaned/retryable state if the final queue update fails after the cascade ran — prevents duplicate Control/Evidence/Audit records on double-click or retry. Same already-decided guard added to zone2_decide and zone3_decide.\n\nI2 (agents/extractor/service.py): _write_to_queue dedupes extracted items against statements already queued for the same document, so a re-extraction (revised doc, or client retry) no longer duplicates queue items.\n\nI7 (evidence_tracker): submit/upload are blocked once evidence is Accepted, and verify requires the item to be in Submitted state — no more silently flipping a verified item back, or ''verifying'' evidence that was never submitted.\n\nAdds 5 tests. Deferred (documented in the hardening audit, need larger/compensating changes): I4 gap orphan compensation, I5 racy ID generation, I6 reject-after-accept withdrawal, I8 procedural re-index swap.","tree":{"sha":"819e4b4ea31821cb584db64ab434d8baae89b808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/819e4b4ea31821cb584db64ab434d8baae89b808"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/62a62ee0b17cd774786bc42428dc2a553a74a156","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/62a62ee0b17cd774786bc42428dc2a553a74a156","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDYyYTYyZWUwYjE3Y2Q3NzQ3ODZiYzQyNDI4ZGMyYTU1M2E3NGExNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/0a6a3b239f7ce337ed03bfec255fcb42f30ad540","sha":"0a6a3b239f7ce337ed03bfec255fcb42f30ad540","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/0a6a3b239f7ce337ed03bfec255fcb42f30ad540"}],"sha":"62a62ee0b17cd774786bc42428dc2a553a74a156","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/62a62ee0b17cd774786bc42428dc2a553a74a156"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/0a6a3b239f7ce337ed03bfec255fcb42f30ad540/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:19:16Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T09:19:16Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"harden: retries + typed failures across Graph and LLM clients (durability Phase 1)\n\nR1 (agents/llm_client.py): retry 429/5xx/timeout with backoff on every LLM backend; add LLMUnavailable and an opt-in raise_on_failure so a real outage is distinguishable from an empty completion (default keeps the historical '''' behaviour, so existing callers with fallbacks are unaffected).\n\nR2 (graph/client.py, exceptions.py): bounded exponential-backoff retry in _request — 429/503 for any method, 502/504/timeout/transport for idempotent reads only (writes are never retried on ambiguous errors, to avoid duplicate SharePoint writes). Retry-After is now read from the response HEADER, not the JSON body.\n\nR3 (agents/extractor/ollama_client.py): extraction opts into raise_on_failure and raises LLMUnavailable when the model is unreachable for every chunk, so a total outage surfaces as a 503 instead of a silent ''total_extracted=0'' success; a genuinely empty document still returns 0.\n\nR4 (review_queue/router.py, control_register/router.py): audit-log write failures are no longer silent — they record a visible ''⚠ AUDIT LOG NOT WRITTEN'' marker on the decided item''s CascadeResult (and _write_audit_log returns its status).\n\nAdds 21 unit tests (graph retry, LLM retry/typed-failure, extraction degraded signal, audit-gap fallback).","tree":{"sha":"740f8f6229417d3c4310136c3932fe629471323c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/740f8f6229417d3c4310136c3932fe629471323c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/0a6a3b239f7ce337ed03bfec255fcb42f30ad540","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.c