rs/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/60d33e883556e9870c3e4f04957219c1729e12f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:27:28Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:27:28Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"ui: show loading state on lifecycle Skip buttons\n\nThe Sensitisation and Review Skip buttons showed no feedback while the request was in flight (they just said ''Skip''), so officers thought nothing happened and retried. They now show ''Finalising…'' / ''Skipping…'' and stay disabled while saving, matching the Submit and Approve buttons. Backend already returns fast now that extraction is backgrounded, so this is a brief, clear indicator.","tree":{"sha":"7a2ea10d3ce42f2b8b1ce70156988bbaa1de375f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/7a2ea10d3ce42f2b8b1ce70156988bbaa1de375f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/60d33e883556e9870c3e4f04957219c1729e12f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/60d33e883556e9870c3e4f04957219c1729e12f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDYwZDMzZTg4MzU1NmU5ODcwYzNlNGYwNDk1NzIxOWMxNzI5ZTEyZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/b87ee4c533e4bf6bda0c8396689b3c32591ddf17","sha":"b87ee4c533e4bf6bda0c8396689b3c32591ddf17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/b87ee4c533e4bf6bda0c8396689b3c32591ddf17"}],"sha":"60d33e883556e9870c3e4f04957219c1729e12f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/60d33e883556e9870c3e4f04957219c1729e12f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/b87ee4c533e4bf6bda0c8396689b3c32591ddf17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:17:23Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T08:17:23Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"perf: run approval extraction in the background so skip/approve return immediately\n\nExtraction (chunked LLM calls) + role-variant classification + procedural-steps indexing runs for tens of seconds. Doing it inline made the skip/approve request appear frozen, so officers retried (harmless — the stage flips early so retries 409 — but confusing).\n\nThe document is already marked Approved and written to the Register synchronously; extraction now runs as a background task (_background_extract_and_flag) and the endpoint returns immediately. The task populates the review queue shortly after, updates LinkedControlsCount, and still appends the non-silent flag to the lifecycle Notes if it finds nothing.","tree":{"sha":"091fc3f244047b7691e89e08b89784e1d149eb5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/091fc3f244047b7691e89e08b89784e1d149eb5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/b87ee4c533e4bf6bda0c8396689b3c32591ddf17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/b87ee4c533e4bf6bda0c8396689b3c32591ddf17","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGI4N2VlNGM1MzNlNGJmNmJkYTBjODM5NjY4OWIzYzMyNTkxZGRmMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/466f9d7a42f7fc3657873e9c077dc6d718263def","sha":"466f9d7a42f7fc3657873e9c077dc6d718263def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/466f9d7a42f7fc3657873e9c077dc6d718263def"}],"sha":"b87ee4c533e4bf6bda0c8396689b3c32591ddf17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/b87ee4c533e4bf6bda0c8396689b3c32591ddf17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/466f9d7a42f7fc3657873e9c077dc6d718263def/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:47:35Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:47:35Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: clamp review-queue ConfidenceScore to [0,1]; fix procedural-steps OData select\n\nExtraction now produces items (after the chunking fix), which surfaced two latent write-path bugs:\n\n1. Classifier role-variant / near-duplicate / conflict writes sent ConfidenceScore straight from the LLM''s semantic_confidence, which is sometimes returned on a 0-100 scale. The Extraction Review ConfidenceScore column is a number capped at 1.0, so values > 1.0 were rejected with 400 invalidRequest. Added _clamp_confidence() (normalises 0-100 -> 0-1, clamps to [0,1], 2 dp) at all three write sites.\n\n2. Procedural Steps Index reads passed select_fields=''id,fields/...'', which Graph rejects (nested field paths are not valid in a top-level $select). Removed the invalid select_fields; get_list_items already returns all fields via $expand=fields.","tree":{"sha":"7cb6e69fb76a37cc0894413dadf31ff32635f5ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/7cb6e69fb76a37cc0894413dadf31ff32635f5ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/466f9d7a42f7fc3657873e9c077dc6d718263def","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/466f9d7a42f7fc3657873e9c077dc6d718263def","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKDQ2NmY5ZDdhNDJmN2ZjMzY1Nzg3M2U5YzA3N2RjNmQ3MTgyNjNkZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/bfbf6ba3db3b41fe4987529d05a9d2dc1a083b3d","sha":"bfbf6ba3db3b41fe4987529d05a9d2dc1a083b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/bfbf6ba3db3b41fe4987529d05a9d2dc1a083b3d"}],"sha":"466f9d7a42f7fc3657873e9c077dc6d718263def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/466f9d7a42f7fc3657873e9c077dc6d718263def"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/bfbf6ba3db3b41fe4987529d05a9d2dc1a083b3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:33:45Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T07:33:45Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: chunk long docs for extraction; surface empty extractions; store register file link\n\nExtractor: raise the per-call cap from 8000 to 50000 chars and split long documents into <=50k paragraph-aware chunks, extracting each and de-duping, so controls past the first window are no longer silently dropped. The 8000-char cap was a leftover from the local-Ollama era; extraction now runs on gpt-4o-mini (128K context) via the gateway.\n\nLifecycle: run extraction before the final approval write-back and record a visible flag on the lifecycle item when no controls were written (0 found / extractor error) instead of failing silently. Fix the Document Register file link: SharePointUrl was batched in one write with a non-existent ''Source'' column, so SharePoint rejected the whole update and the URL never stored -- now written on its own.","tree":{"sha":"56cb54a327754545f284fed5001f4edd49d36bfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/56cb54a327754545f284fed5001f4edd49d36bfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/bfbf6ba3db3b41fe4987529d05a9d2dc1a083b3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/bfbf6ba3db3b41fe4987529d05a9d2dc1a083b3d","node_id":"C_kwDOSaybPNoAKGJmYmY2YmEzZGIzYjQxZmU0OTg3NTI5ZDA1YTlkMmRjMWEwODNiM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol/Orgos/commit/7da5e8708ed06d84639fe0c3e286a6a668e26219","sha":"7da5e8708ed06d84639fe0c3e286a6a668e26219","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/7da5e8708ed06d84639fe0c3e286a6a668e26219"}],"sha":"bfbf6ba3db3b41fe4987529d05a9d2dc1a083b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/bfbf6ba3db3b41fe4987529d05a9d2dc1a083b3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/commits/7da5e8708ed06d84639fe0c3e286a6a668e26219/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T22:45:26Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T22:45:26Z","email":"paulkayode2018@gmail.com","name":"kelpejol"},"message":"fix: auto-finalise document when approver is skipped; disable CDI vague-term checks\n\nLifecycle: skipping the approver at Sensitisation now publishes the document straight to the Document Register and marks it Approved (with an audit note), instead of leaving it stuck in the Approval stage with no assignable approver. The approval cascade is extracted into a shared _finalize_document_approval helper reused by both the manual approve and the skip path.\n\nCDI checker: comment out CDI-07 (vague role) and CDI-08 (vague evidence) checks in both the AI and fallback paths.","tree":{"sha":"f436e67cb776d1e36c69d7e4315a5d2e9b03855d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/trees/f436e67cb776d1e36c69d7e4315a5d2e9b03855d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kelpejol/Orgos/git/commits/7da5e8708ed06d84639fe0c3e286a6a668e26219","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141008634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kelpejol","id":141008634,"login":"Kelpejol","node_id":"U_kgDOCGee-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kelpejol/subs